Dialogue: 2,0:01:31.21,0:01:33.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}太危险了！
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.21,0:01:33.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.17,0:01:34.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}别停！
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.17,0:01:34.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Keep moving!
Dialogue: 2,0:01:34.42,0:01:36.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就从这儿过去。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.42,0:01:36.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This is the way through.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:37.71,0:01:39.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}加油！
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.71,0:01:39.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on!
Dialogue: 2,0:01:39.17,0:01:41.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我没法再往前了。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.17,0:01:41.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can't go any further.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:41.17,0:01:42.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快动！
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.17,0:01:42.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Move!
Dialogue: 2,0:02:03.83,0:02:05.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}地震了！
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.83,0:02:05.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Earthquake!
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.33,0:02:44.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗨，大伙儿！我是Danger D。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.33,0:02:44.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, guys! Danger D here.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.75,0:02:47.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}全网都在聊FallGi rl，根本停不下来。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.75,0:02:47.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The Internet cannot stop talking about FallGirl.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:47.29,0:02:49.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}人气网红 Shiloh Hunter
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.29,0:02:49.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Popular influencer Shiloh Hunter
Dialogue: 2,0:02:49.25,0:02:50.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有她的朋友Becky
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.25,0:02:50.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and her friend Becky
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.67,0:02:53.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}决定全靠自己爬上一座塔
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.67,0:02:53.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}decided to climb a tower all by themselves
Dialogue: 2,0:02:53.08,0:02:54.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}结果酿成了悲剧。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.08,0:02:54.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and it ended in tragedy.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.75,0:02:56.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在2,000英尺高空
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.75,0:02:56.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}2,000 feet in the air
Dialogue: 2,0:02:56.46,0:02:58.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在荒郊野外的一座塔上。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.46,0:02:58.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}on a tower in the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:58.33,0:03:00.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我们成功了！  -耶！
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.33,0:03:00.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-We made it!   -Whoo!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:00.75,0:03:02.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}现在爆火的那个视频，你看了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.75,0:03:02.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Did you see the video that's going viral right now?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:02.96,0:03:05.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}小心，D！
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.96,0:03:05.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Danger D!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:05.46,0:03:07.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那段视频？摔下去那段？
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.46,0:03:07.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That clip? The one of the fall?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:08.92,0:03:10.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我的天啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.92,0:03:10.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.17,0:03:11.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Hunter，你没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.17,0:03:11.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hunter, are you okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:11.46,0:03:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你得把我拉上去！
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.46,0:03:12.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're gonna have to pull me up!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:13.00,0:03:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-这不该发到网上。  -我心跳都停了。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.00,0:03:14.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-This should not be online.   -My heart stopped.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:14.88,0:03:18.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}下不去，也没法求救。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.88,0:03:18.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No way down and no way to call for help.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:18.88,0:03:20.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你本以为
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.88,0:03:20.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You would've thought
Dialogue: 2,0:03:20.38,0:03:22.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Hunter的故事就会到此为止。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.38,0:03:22.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}that Hunter's story would've ended there.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:22.67,0:03:25.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有，眼看着Shil oh的悲剧成了潮流。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.67,0:03:25.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And seeing Shiloh's tragedy turned into a trend.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:25.92,0:03:27.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}网上到处都是。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.92,0:03:27.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's all over the internet.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:27.25,0:03:31.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她的粉丝都自称“跟摔粉”了。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.25,0:03:31.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Fans are even calling themselves her 'fall-owers'.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:31.25,0:03:34.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Shiloh那辆破旧的Bronco 在eBay上出现了。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.25,0:03:34.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shiloh's crusty Bronco showed up on eBay.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:34.08,0:03:35.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是Hunter那辆 有名的Bronco！
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.08,0:03:35.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's Hunter's famous Bronco!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:35.58,0:03:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这些人想干的事，简直太不尊重人了。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.58,0:03:38.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's just, like, disrespectful what these people try and do.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:38.04,0:03:41.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-那是FallGirl的妹妹！  -不！我不想拍照。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.04,0:03:41.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-That's FallGirl's sister!   -No! I don't want any photos.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:41.29,0:03:43.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她做过的那些疯狂透顶的特技里，
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.29,0:03:43.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Amidst all the crazy, crazy stunts she's done,
Dialogue: 2,0:03:43.75,0:03:45.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我觉得她那番话里，真有些动人的东西。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.75,0:03:45.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I think there's some real beauty in what she had to say.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:45.96,0:03:49.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你得做点让自己觉得真活着的事。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.96,0:03:49.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You have to do something that makes you feel alive.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:49.75,0:03:51.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}刚才太精彩了。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.75,0:03:51.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That was amazing.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:51.58,0:03:54.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不过别担心，你掉下去也照样出名。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.58,0:03:54.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But don't worry, you'll still be famous if you fall.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:58.67,0:04:01.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我姐说了不少你的事。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.67,0:04:01.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}My sister talked a lot about you.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:02.08,0:04:03.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}把你当家人。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.08,0:04:03.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Considered you family.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:03.88,0:04:05.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没想到咱俩以前从没见过。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.88,0:04:05.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm surprised we never met.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:06.88,0:04:09.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃……警察把它找回来了
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.88,0:04:09.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The, um... police recovered it
Dialogue: 2,0:04:09.58,0:04:11.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}几周前。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.58,0:04:11.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}a few weeks back.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:11.88,0:04:13.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我收到过不少邀约，可……
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.88,0:04:13.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I had a lot of offers, but...
Dialogue: 2,0:04:14.00,0:04:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}谢谢。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.00,0:04:15.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:15.92,0:04:19.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我才不把它卖给那种疯狂的铁杆粉丝。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.92,0:04:19.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm not gonna sell it to one of those crazy hardcore fans.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:19.29,0:04:21.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这我能理解。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.29,0:04:21.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can understand that.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:23.04,0:04:24.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天哪。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.04,0:04:24.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jesus.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:31.17,0:04:33.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这挺熟悉的。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.17,0:04:33.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's familiar.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.88,0:04:41.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦呵呵。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.88,0:04:41.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh-ho-ho.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:41.04,0:04:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}靠。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.04,0:04:42.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shit.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:43.00,0:04:44.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.00,0:04:44.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.21,0:04:48.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.21,0:04:48.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What is it?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:50.17,0:04:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你姐妹发的帖子，你一条都没看？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.17,0:04:52.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You didn't watch any of your sister's posts?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:56.12,0:04:58.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这算是她的终极人生愿望清单。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.12,0:04:58.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's, like, her ultimate bucket list.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:58.50,0:05:03.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她策划的每次疯狂冒险、 每场玩命特技
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.50,0:05:03.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Every single crazy adventure and insane stunt she planned
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.21,0:05:04.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在这里面。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.21,0:05:04.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}is in here.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:05.38,0:05:09.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她正想办法熬过这一切，可……
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.38,0:05:09.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She was trying to make her way through it all, but...
Dialogue: 2,0:05:09.42,0:05:11.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}……勉强才到一半。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.42,0:05:11.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}..barely made it half way.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:15.79,0:05:18.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我给这几页拍两张照片，可以吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.79,0:05:18.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Do you mind if I take a couple of pictures of these pages?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:18.71,0:05:19.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，当然。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.71,0:05:19.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, sure.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:39.33,0:05:41.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Shi，我改主意了。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.33,0:05:41.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shi, I changed my mind.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:41.58,0:05:44.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎，拜托。别当怂包。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.58,0:05:44.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, come on. Don't be a little bitch.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:47.08,0:05:49.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}都这时候了，我可不让你认怂。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.08,0:05:49.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I am not letting you wuss out now.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:59.04,0:06:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这样吧，给你了。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.04,0:06:01.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know what? You can have it.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:01.08,0:06:03.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}拿着吧。全拿去。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.08,0:06:03.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Just take it. Take all of it.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:03.21,0:06:05.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你就……呃，就算帮我个忙。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.21,0:06:05.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You'd be, uh... you'd be doing me a favour.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:05.46,0:06:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你确定吗？  -嗯。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.46,0:06:07.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Are you sure?   -Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:07.04,0:06:09.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，这……这都是Shiloh。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.04,0:06:09.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, this... this is all Shiloh.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:09.46,0:06:12.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。不，你拿着吧。我……
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.46,0:06:12.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah. No, please take it. I...
Dialogue: 2,0:06:12.50,0:06:15.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我厨房里还有一大堆呢，我没法……
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.50,0:06:15.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I have, like, a ton more in the kitchen and I can't...
Dialogue: 2,0:06:15.58,0:06:18.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不……我不要。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.58,0:06:18.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't... I don't want it.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:18.08,0:06:19.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，没事的。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.08,0:06:19.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, it's okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:19.46,0:06:22.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-对不起。  -不用，不用道歉。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.46,0:06:22.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Sorry.   -No, don't apologise.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:26.67,0:06:31.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我最后一次看到那个， 也是最后一次见她。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.67,0:06:31.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The last time I saw that was the last time I saw her.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:31.58,0:06:34.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我……我说了不该说的话
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.58,0:06:34.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I... I said something that I shouldn't have
Dialogue: 2,0:06:34.67,0:06:36.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我都快被这事折磨死了。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.67,0:06:36.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and it's killing me.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:38.04,0:06:39.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有，呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.04,0:06:39.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And, uh...
Dialogue: 2,0:06:40.71,0:06:44.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我脑子转不动，饭也吃不下
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.71,0:06:44.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can't think or eat
Dialogue: 2,0:06:44.75,0:06:47.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要不……睡觉，要不……
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.75,0:06:47.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}or... sleep or...
Dialogue: 2,0:06:47.67,0:06:49.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗨。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.67,0:06:49.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:49.04,0:06:50.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，没事的。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.04,0:06:50.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, it's okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:55.29,0:06:58.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}- 就当是药吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.29,0:06:58.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}- Consider it medicine.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:15.00,0:07:16.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}说不定那正是你需要的。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.00,0:07:16.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Maybe that's what you need.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:17.50,0:07:20.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}为了把Shiloh开了头的事做完。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.50,0:07:20.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}To finish something that Shiloh started.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:20.58,0:07:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你什么意思？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.58,0:07:22.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 2,0:07:22.04,0:07:24.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}往前走吧。给自己一个交代。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.04,0:07:24.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Move on. Get the closure you need.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:24.33,0:07:26.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你可以把她的清单做完。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.33,0:07:26.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You can finish her list.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:27.12,0:07:29.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}一次一页。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.12,0:07:29.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}One page ata time.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:30.38,0:07:32.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们甚至能用她的相机拍。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.38,0:07:32.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We can even shoot it on her camera.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:32.71,0:07:34.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真有'Danger D'的范儿。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.71,0:07:34.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Real 'Danger D' style.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:34.42,0:07:36.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你干嘛要帮我啊？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.42,0:07:36.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Why do you even want to help me?
Dialogue: 2,0:07:36.79,0:07:38.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你根本不认识我。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.79,0:07:38.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You don't even know me.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:41.96,0:07:43.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我认识你姐的时候……
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.96,0:07:43.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}When I met your sister...
Dialogue: 2,0:07:45.42,0:07:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我那时……连自己的影子都怕。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.42,0:07:51.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I was... scared of my own shadow.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:53.46,0:07:55.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可她骨子里有那么一股劲儿
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.46,0:07:55.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But there was something in her spirit
Dialogue: 2,0:07:55.79,0:07:59.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那让我有勇气面对那些糟透了的破事。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.79,0:07:59.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}that gave me the strength to face some really dark shit.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:00.83,0:08:02.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.83,0:08:02.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hm.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:04.21,0:08:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她本来下一站要去泰国。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.21,0:08:07.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Her next stop was gonna be Thailand.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:07.54,0:08:09.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Mount Kwan的木栈道。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.54,0:08:09.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The plank walk of Mount Kwan.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:09.54,0:08:10.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.54,0:08:10.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The what?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:11.58,0:08:14.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这是Shi最后发的 几篇帖子之一。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.58,0:08:14.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This was from one of Shi's last posts.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:14.38,0:08:16.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}步道拐着弯绕过Devil's Elbow
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.38,0:08:16.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The walk twists around the Devil's Elbow
Dialogue: 2,0:08:16.12,0:08:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}海拔4,000英尺
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.12,0:08:18.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}which sits 4,000 feet above sea level
Dialogue: 2,0:08:18.88,0:08:20.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}终点是一座神像
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.88,0:08:20.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}ending in a spiritual statue
Dialogue: 2,0:08:20.96,0:08:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}当地人管它叫“The Deth Dragon”。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.96,0:08:23.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}the locals call "The Deth Dragon'.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:23.17,0:08:25.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听说等你到了龙那儿，
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.17,0:08:25.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}They say when you make it to the dragon,
Dialogue: 2,0:08:25.29,0:08:27.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}它会吃掉你的恐惧。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.29,0:08:27.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}it eats your fears.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:29.96,0:08:31.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}跟我来。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.96,0:08:31.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come with me.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:35.12,0:08:37.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不。抱歉。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.12,0:08:37.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No. Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:38.12,0:08:39.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没事。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.12,0:08:39.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:44.17,0:08:48.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不像我姐。我不勇敢。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.17,0:08:48.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm not like my sister. I'm not brave.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:49.54,0:08:50.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.54,0:08:50.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Um...
Dialogue: 2,0:08:51.96,0:08:53.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我有份工作。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.96,0:08:53.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I have a job.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:53.67,0:08:55.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有……
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.67,0:08:55.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And...
Dialogue: 2,0:08:55.08,0:08:56.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}一条命。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.08,0:08:56.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}a life.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:01.88,0:09:02.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.88,0:09:02.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Do you?
Dialogue: 2,0:09:02.92,0:09:06.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}现在，你可以自由了。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.92,0:09:06.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This is your moment to be free.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:10.83,0:09:12.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}留着吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.83,0:09:12.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Keep it.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:13.04,0:09:14.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax，你想想。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.04,0:09:14.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Think about it, Jax.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:14.54,0:09:16.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可能就是那时候
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.54,0:09:16.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It might be that point in time
Dialogue: 2,0:09:16.12,0:09:19.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这事现在不做，可能一辈子都不会做了。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.12,0:09:19.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}where if you don't do it now you might never.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:43.75,0:09:46.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Shi，看着我！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.75,0:09:46.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shi, look at me!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:54.38,0:09:57.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-Shi，我做到了！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.38,0:09:57.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Shi, I did it!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:59.25,0:10:01.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}靠！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.25,0:10:01.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shi!
Dialogue: 2,0:11:14.17,0:11:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呼！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.17,0:11:15.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Whoo!
Dialogue: 2,0:11:15.17,0:11:17.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-哇！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.17,0:11:17.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Wow!
Dialogue: 2,0:11:29.83,0:11:31.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Hunter在论坛上看到的
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.83,0:11:31.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hunter read in a forum
Dialogue: 2,0:11:31.33,0:11:33.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们能找到向导带我们登顶
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.33,0:11:33.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}that we can find a guide to take us to the top
Dialogue: 2,0:11:33.29,0:11:35.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在一家叫 High Spirits 的酒吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.29,0:11:35.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}at a bar called High Spirits.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:35.79,0:11:38.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你觉得“岩壁上的Ic arus”是啥意思？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.79,0:11:38.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What do you think "Icarus on the rocks" means?
Dialogue: 2,0:11:39.71,0:11:41.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不知道。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.71,0:11:41.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No idea.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:41.92,0:11:44.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，那咱们得离开游客步道
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.92,0:11:44.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, so, we'll have to divert from the tourist walk
Dialogue: 2,0:11:44.75,0:11:47.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}再走Deth Dragon路线到西峰。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.75,0:11:47.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and take the Deth Dragon route to the western peak.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:47.29,0:11:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Hunter的笔记上 说，已经封了几十年。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.29,0:11:50.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hunter's notes say it's been closed for decades.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:50.08,0:11:51.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对普通人来说太危险了。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.08,0:11:51.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Too dangerous for the general public.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:51.83,0:11:53.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}警察拦住了人贩子
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.83,0:11:53.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Police have stopped traffickers
Dialogue: 2,0:11:54.00,0:11:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}大批运送芬太尼、海洛因和可卡因
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.00,0:11:56.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}moving large shipments of fentanyl, heroin and cocaine
Dialogue: 2,0:11:56.96,0:11:58.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}越过边境去Myanmar。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.96,0:11:58.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}over the border to Myanmar.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:58.62,0:12:01.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}警方在Mount Kwan National Park设的检查站
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.62,0:12:01.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The police checkpoints set up at Mount Kwan National Park
Dialogue: 2,0:12:01.71,0:12:02.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}已经证明了……
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.71,0:12:02.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}have proved...
Dialogue: 2,0:12:02.79,0:12:04.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他们设了警察检查站
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.79,0:12:04.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}They have police checkpoints
Dialogue: 2,0:12:04.42,0:12:06.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在 Mount Kwan 登山步道入口。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.42,0:12:06.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}at the entrance to the Mount Kwan trail.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:06.71,0:12:09.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他们肯定不会手下留情。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.71,0:12:09.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}They take no prisoners, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:09.33,0:12:10.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他们在找运毒的
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.33,0:12:10.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}They're looking for drug runners
Dialogue: 2,0:12:10.83,0:12:13.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}想把毒品偷运过境，运到缅甸
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.83,0:12:13.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}trying to smuggle drugs over the border to Myanmar
Dialogue: 2,0:12:13.04,0:12:14.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}走那条封闭的路线。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.04,0:12:14.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}via the closed route.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:14.71,0:12:16.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我的天啊。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.71,0:12:16.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:16.54,0:12:19.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们只是绕个路的游客。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.54,0:12:19.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We're just tourists taking a diversion.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:19.62,0:12:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}别担心。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.62,0:12:20.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:34.25,0:12:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax，快看！
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.25,0:12:35.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jax, look!
Dialogue: 2,0:12:52.46,0:12:56.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哥们！这也太酷了！
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.46,0:12:56.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Dude! This is so sick!
Dialogue: 2,0:12:57.54,0:12:59.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哇，那看着也太棒了！
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.54,0:12:59.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, man, that looks so good!
Dialogue: 2,0:13:12.54,0:13:14.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有点闹腾！耶！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.54,0:13:14.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}A little rowdy! Yes!
Dialogue: 2,0:13:32.79,0:13:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对不起。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.79,0:13:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:33.96,0:13:35.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}绕过去！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.96,0:13:35.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Go around!
Dialogue: 2,0:13:39.50,0:13:40.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哼！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.50,0:13:40.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hmph!
Dialogue: 2,0:13:40.50,0:13:42.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯……
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.50,0:13:42.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Um...
Dialogue: 2,0:13:53.04,0:13:54.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我能怎么帮你？
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.04,0:13:54.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}How can I help you?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:55.79,0:13:57.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，糟了，呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.79,0:13:57.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, bad, um...
Dialogue: 2,0:13:57.38,0:13:58.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有人跟我们说，就是这儿
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.38,0:13:58.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We were told that this is the place
Dialogue: 2,0:13:58.75,0:14:00.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}去请个向导带着走木板。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.75,0:14:00.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}to ask for a guide for the plank walk.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:00.62,0:14:03.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，要不是七月，那倒是。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.62,0:14:03.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, it would be if it wasn't July.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:03.12,0:14:04.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.12,0:14:04.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh...
Dialogue: 2,0:14:04.54,0:14:05.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对不起。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.54,0:14:05.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:05.62,0:14:10.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有人让我们打听一下Deth Dragon Trail。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.62,0:14:10.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We were told to enquire about the Deth Dragon Trail.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:11.00,0:14:13.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}“Deth”拼作D-E-T-H。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.00,0:14:13.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}'Deth' spelled D-E-T-H.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:13.46,0:14:16.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}前提是那在英语里不是同一个意思。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.46,0:14:16.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Assuming that doesn't mean the same thing in English.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:16.17,0:14:19.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，对。可那条步道封了。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.17,0:14:19.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, yeah, it does. But that trail is closed.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:19.21,0:14:22.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}地震很危险，搞得这儿很不安全。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.21,0:14:22.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Dangerous earthquakes made it very unsafe.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:22.42,0:14:25.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}东游客峰，开放着。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.42,0:14:25.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The Eastern Tourist Peak. That's open.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:26.29,0:14:28.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可我还是那句话，你来的季节不对。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.29,0:14:28.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But, again, you're in the wrong season.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:28.58,0:14:31.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有，这只适合有经验的攀岩者
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.58,0:14:31.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And it's for experienced climbers only
Dialogue: 2,0:14:31.67,0:14:33.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这个时节。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.67,0:14:33.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}this time of year.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:39.62,0:14:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}喝一杯怎么样？
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.62,0:14:40.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}How about a drink?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:43.25,0:14:46.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要不……叫“岩壁上的Icarus”？
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.25,0:14:46.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}How about... "Icarus on the rocks"?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:48.38,0:14:50.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}- 嗯。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.38,0:14:50.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}- Mm.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:50.21,0:14:51.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你确定？
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.21,0:14:51.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You sure?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:54.79,0:14:56.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，我们确定。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.79,0:14:56.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, we're sure.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:57.92,0:14:59.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}把那台摄像机关了。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.92,0:14:59.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shut off that camera.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:08.92,0:15:10.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}跟他谈谈。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.92,0:15:10.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Talk to him.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:12.75,0:15:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，谢谢。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.75,0:15:14.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:24.46,0:15:27.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们是来喝加冰的Icarus吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.46,0:15:27.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We're here for the Icarus on the rocks?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:39.67,0:15:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}请坐。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.67,0:15:40.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Take a seat.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:44.58,0:15:47.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我叫Luce，这是Jax。  -嗨。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.58,0:15:47.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I'm Luce. This is Jax.   -Hey.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:48.67,0:15:50.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jon.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.67,0:15:50.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jon.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:53.29,0:15:55.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道自己在提什么要求吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.29,0:15:55.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Do you know what you're asking?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:57.62,0:16:00.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们在找个向导，Jon。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.62,0:16:00.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We're looking for a guide, Jon.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:01.92,0:16:03.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.92,0:16:03.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:03.75,0:16:07.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你这是在求人带你去违法攀爬
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.75,0:16:07.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're asking for someone to lead you on an illegal climb
Dialogue: 2,0:16:07.12,0:16:10.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在泰国最危险的步道上。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.12,0:16:10.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}on the most dangerous trail in Thailand.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:12.71,0:16:14.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那有问题吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.71,0:16:14.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:18.83,0:16:20.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.83,0:16:20.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hmm.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:28.33,0:16:30.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}只针对你的银行账户。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.33,0:16:30.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Only for your bank account.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:31.12,0:16:32.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说……
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.12,0:16:32.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean...
Dialogue: 2,0:16:32.33,0:16:35.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们也许能咬咬牙出到$3,000。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.33,0:16:35.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We could maybe stretch to $3,000.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:35.38,0:16:37.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可跟这个比，差远了。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.38,0:16:37.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But nowhere near this.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:40.96,0:16:42.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.96,0:16:42.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hm.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:45.79,0:16:47.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}往那几棵树后面看。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.79,0:16:47.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look past those trees.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:47.71,0:16:49.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}看见没？那大混蛋正从上头看着咱们。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.71,0:16:49.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You see that big son of a bitch looking down on us
Dialogue: 2,0:16:49.75,0:16:52.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}像Godzilla那个气炸了的哥哥？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.75,0:16:52.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}like Godzilla's pissed off big brother?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:53.83,0:16:55.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那是 Mount Kwan。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.83,0:16:55.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's Mount Kwan.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:56.58,0:16:58.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有你问的那条步道，
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.58,0:16:58.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And the trail you're asking about,
Dialogue: 2,0:16:58.75,0:17:01.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这儿已经三十多年不对公众开放了。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.75,0:17:01.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}it's been closed to the public for over three decades.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:01.50,0:17:03.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}警察要是抓住你，你就知道了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.50,0:17:03.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}If the cops catch you, you're gonna find out
Dialogue: 2,0:17:03.67,0:17:05.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你一眨眼就不在Kansas了。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.67,0:17:05.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}you're not in Kansas anymore real quick.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:05.79,0:17:09.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你要是迷路了，就会找到救援人员
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.79,0:17:09.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}If you get lost, you're gonna find the emergency services
Dialogue: 2,0:17:09.21,0:17:10.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要么不会说你的语言
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.21,0:17:10.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}either don't speak your language
Dialogue: 2,0:17:10.88,0:17:13.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}或者压根他妈不在乎。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.88,0:17:13.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}or don't give two shits.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:14.21,0:17:17.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}再说这时候是雨季，要是下雨，
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.21,0:17:17.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And this time of year, wet season, if it rains,
Dialogue: 2,0:17:17.38,0:17:20.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那些木板会跟溜冰场一样滑。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.38,0:17:20.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}those planks are gonna be as slippery as an ice rink.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:20.17,0:17:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有人说过你很会说话吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.17,0:17:22.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Anyone ever tell you you have a way with words?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:24.54,0:17:25.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.54,0:17:25.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:25.42,0:17:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这条路危险到头了。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.42,0:17:29.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This trail is as dangerous as it gets.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:29.17,0:17:30.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我能带你上去，到龙跟前
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.17,0:17:30.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can get you up to the dragon
Dialogue: 2,0:17:30.75,0:17:33.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}再从Myanmar那一侧下去
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.75,0:17:33.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and back down the other side in Myanmar
Dialogue: 2,0:17:33.04,0:17:34.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}太阳下山前。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.04,0:17:34.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}before sunset.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:34.38,0:17:37.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那张餐巾纸上的价，挺划算。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.38,0:17:37.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The number on that napkin is a bargain.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:37.96,0:17:39.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}而且没得商量。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.96,0:17:39.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And non-negotiable.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:45.88,0:17:47.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}女士们，祝你们今晚过得愉快。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.88,0:17:47.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Have a lovely evening, ladies.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:50.88,0:17:52.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等等。等等。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.88,0:17:52.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:53.92,0:17:56.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-这钱我们付。  -Luce。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.92,0:17:56.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-We'll pay it.   -Luce.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:57.38,0:18:00.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我付不起。  -我请客。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.38,0:18:00.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I can't afford that.   -It's on me.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:00.21,0:18:01.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}献给Shiloh。
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.21,0:18:01.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}For Shiloh.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:53.08,0:18:55.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}高度设好了。准备跳。
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.08,0:18:55.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Altitude set. Prepare to jump.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:55.29,0:18:57.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}加油，Jax！
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.29,0:18:57.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on, Jax!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:05.00,0:19:07.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天哪，我做不到。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.00,0:19:07.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, God, I can't do this.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:07.58,0:19:09.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你能行！就信自己一回，跳吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.58,0:19:09.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yes, you can! It's just a leap of faith.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:09.67,0:19:10.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，我做不到！
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.67,0:19:10.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, I can't!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:10.71,0:19:12.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，深吸一口气，
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.71,0:19:12.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, take a deep breath,
Dialogue: 2,0:19:12.04,0:19:13.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}闭上眼睛，数到十。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.04,0:19:13.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}close your eyes, and count to ten.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:13.88,0:19:17.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不行！我还不了解你？ 你他妈没准数到七就跳！
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.88,0:19:17.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No! 'Cause I know you! You'll jump at seven or some shit!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:17.17,0:19:18.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}加油！
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.17,0:19:18.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:18.50,0:19:21.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}连你姐都信不过，你还能信谁？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.50,0:19:21.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}If you can't trust your big sister, who can you trust?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:21.88,0:19:24.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}行吗？准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.88,0:19:24.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay? Ready?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:24.62,0:19:26.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-一……  -一……
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.62,0:19:26.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-One...   -One...
Dialogue: 2,0:19:26.12,0:19:29.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}二、三……
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.12,0:19:29.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Two, three...
Dialogue: 2,0:20:11.75,0:20:13.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-嗨。  -嗨。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.75,0:20:13.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Hey.   -Hey.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:14.00,0:20:15.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你看着不太像Hunter。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.00,0:20:15.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You don't look very Hunter.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:15.71,0:20:17.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我可不是我姐。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.71,0:20:17.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, I'm not my sister.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:17.96,0:20:19.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.96,0:20:19.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Right.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:23.62,0:20:25.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，姑娘们，来给你们配装备。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.62,0:20:25.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. Let's get you ladies kitted out.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:26.00,0:20:28.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}安全带给你……你也有一条。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.00,0:20:28.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Harness for you... and for you.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:32.08,0:20:33.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}氧气瓶。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.08,0:20:33.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}O2 tanks.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:33.17,0:20:35.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这些可不便宜，别弄丢了。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.17,0:20:35.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}These are not cheap so do not lose them.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:35.38,0:20:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}咱们为什么要用这些？
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.38,0:20:36.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Why do we need these?
Dialogue: 2,0:20:37.00,0:20:38.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}山路上的弯道。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.00,0:20:38.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Mountain bends.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:40.75,0:20:42.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}高原反应。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.75,0:20:42.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Altitude sickness.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:42.12,0:20:43.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}一到高处，人就可能发慌。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.12,0:20:43.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Heights, they can mess with people.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:44.00,0:20:46.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}头疼、幻觉、恶心。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.00,0:20:46.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Headaches, hallucinations, nausea.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:46.54,0:20:47.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}更糟。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.54,0:20:47.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Worse.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:47.71,0:20:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你不拿一个吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.71,0:20:49.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're not taking one?
Dialogue: 2,0:20:49.12,0:20:51.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我已经有耐受性了，用不着。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.12,0:20:51.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Developed a tolerance. I don't need one.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:55.25,0:20:58.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-试音，试音...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.25,0:20:58.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Testing, testing...
Dialogue: 2,0:20:58.25,0:20:59.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}以防有紧急情况。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.25,0:20:59.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}In case of emergencies.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:59.79,0:21:01.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听着，咱们别走散，可万一走散了，
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.79,0:21:01.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Now, we shouldn't get split up, but if we do,
Dialogue: 2,0:21:01.83,0:21:03.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你可以联系我。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.83,0:21:03.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}you can contact me.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:05.62,0:21:07.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，我们都准备好了。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.62,0:21:07.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. We're all set.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:07.75,0:21:10.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不带走的东西都扔进各自的储物柜
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.75,0:21:10.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Dump anything that's not coming with us in your lockers
Dialogue: 2,0:21:10.38,0:21:12.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}咱们这就可以开始了。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.38,0:21:12.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and we're good to go.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:29.25,0:21:31.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听起来你姐以前挺有意思的。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.25,0:21:31.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Your sister sounds like she was fun.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:31.46,0:21:33.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她会为你们骄傲的。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.46,0:21:33.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She'd be proud of you guys.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:33.96,0:21:35.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你呢？有什么故事？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.96,0:21:35.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So, what's your story?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:35.62,0:21:38.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，呃……我来这儿旅游，
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.62,0:21:38.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, uh... came out here travelling,
Dialogue: 2,0:21:38.33,0:21:40.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}到现在差不多八年了。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.33,0:21:40.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}about eight years ago now.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:40.12,0:21:41.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你一个人？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.12,0:21:41.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}On your own?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:41.79,0:21:43.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}跟我未婚妻一起。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.79,0:21:43.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}With my fiancée.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:43.42,0:21:46.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-她在哪儿？  -Ohio。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.42,0:21:46.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Where is she?   -Ohio.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:54.79,0:21:56.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}加油。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.79,0:21:56.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:04.50,0:22:05.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}加油。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.50,0:22:05.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:25.83,0:22:27.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这个从这儿穿过去
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.83,0:22:27.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This through here
Dialogue: 2,0:22:27.12,0:22:29.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}到这儿才真的开始有意思。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.12,0:22:29.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}is where it really starts to get interesting.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:30.67,0:22:33.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}来，跟紧点。快到梯子那儿了。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.67,0:22:33.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Now, stay close. We're almost at the ladders.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:35.17,0:22:37.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}女士优先。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.17,0:22:37.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ladies first.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:48.21,0:22:50.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}给我滚过来！
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.21,0:22:50.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Get your ass over here.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:20.38,0:23:24.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那咱们顺着这梯子能往 上爬4,000英尺。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.38,0:23:24.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So, this ladder will take us up 4,000 feet.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:24.25,0:23:26.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}往右走，到那条古栈道。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.25,0:23:26.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Right to the ancient plank walk.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:26.38,0:23:28.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这个绕着整个山顶一圈。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.38,0:23:28.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This wraps around the entire mountain cap.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:28.71,0:23:29.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:28.71,0:23:29.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:29.62,0:23:31.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你们几个姑娘之前想爬座山。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.62,0:23:31.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You girls wanted to climb a mountain.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:31.88,0:23:33.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在这儿。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.88,0:23:33.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Here it is.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:37.08,0:23:38.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对不起啊，各位。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.08,0:23:38.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:40.04,0:23:42.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我觉得这不适合我。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.04,0:23:42.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't think this is for me.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:42.12,0:23:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没看起来那么吓人。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:42.12,0:23:44.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's not as scary as it looks.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:44.08,0:23:47.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听我说，我知道你可能不相信自己。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:44.08,0:23:47.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look, I know you might not believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:47.79,0:23:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可Shiloh做了。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:47.79,0:23:49.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But Shiloh did.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:49.96,0:23:51.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我也相信你。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.96,0:23:51.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And I believe in you.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:53.25,0:23:55.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}反正咱们有了个看着还行的攀岩者。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:53.25,0:23:55.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And, anyway, we got an okay-looking climber.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:55.88,0:23:58.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他会替咱们兜底。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:55.88,0:23:58.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}He's gonna cover our asses.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:59.25,0:24:00.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}咱们能搞定。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:59.25,0:24:00.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We got this.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:01.62,0:24:02.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}一起。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:01.62,0:24:02.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Together.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:02.71,0:24:06.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，别忘了你当初为什么来这儿。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:02.71,0:24:06.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, remember why you're here in the first place.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:06.08,0:24:07.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，姑娘们。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:06.08,0:24:07.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, girls.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:07.75,0:24:10.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我给你俩装一套双钩系统。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:07.75,0:24:10.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm gonna set you both up with a twin-hook system.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:10.38,0:24:13.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好了，看看紧不紧。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:10.38,0:24:13.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}There. Make sure it's tight.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:14.50,0:24:15.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有那儿。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:14.50,0:24:15.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And there.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:15.42,0:24:18.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}现在，把这两根安全绳都
Dialogue: 1,0:24:15.42,0:24:18.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Now, put both of these safety lines
Dialogue: 2,0:24:18.50,0:24:20.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}到你安全带那儿...
Dialogue: 1,0:24:18.50,0:24:20.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}onto your harness there...
Dialogue: 2,0:24:20.50,0:24:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有这儿。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:20.50,0:24:22.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and here.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:22.12,0:24:23.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不错。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:22.12,0:24:23.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Cool.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:24.33,0:24:26.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，等我们走到梯子那儿，
Dialogue: 1,0:24:24.33,0:24:26.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Now, when we come to the ladders,
Dialogue: 2,0:24:26.54,0:24:29.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我要你扣上这几根安全链。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:26.54,0:24:29.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I want you to clip in these safety chains.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:29.79,0:24:31.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}然后解开，再扣上
Dialogue: 1,0:24:29.79,0:24:31.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Then unclip and reclip
Dialogue: 2,0:24:31.33,0:24:34.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}看到这些锚点中的一个时。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:31.33,0:24:34.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}when you see one of these anchor points.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:34.12,0:24:36.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}扣上，解开。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:34.12,0:24:36.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Clip in, clip out.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:36.50,0:24:39.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你得确保随时至少有一个锁扣挂着。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:36.50,0:24:39.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You make sure at least one clip is attached at all times.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:39.79,0:24:41.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这能救你一命。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:39.79,0:24:41.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It'll save your life.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:41.67,0:24:42.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}懂了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:24:41.67,0:24:42.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Got it?
Dialogue: 2,0:24:42.96,0:24:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}遵命，船长！
Dialogue: 1,0:24:42.96,0:24:44.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Aye-aye, Cap'n.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:44.12,0:24:46.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}上面见。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:44.12,0:24:46.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}See you up there.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:52.29,0:24:54.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你连自己的规矩都不守？
Dialogue: 1,0:24:52.29,0:24:54.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're not gonna follow your own rules?
Dialogue: 2,0:24:54.29,0:24:56.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}照我说的做，别学我。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:54.29,0:24:56.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Do as I say, not as I do.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:02.12,0:25:04.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧，我先来。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:02.12,0:25:04.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, I'll go first.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:04.25,0:25:06.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。小心点。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:04.25,0:25:06.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. Be careful.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:13.33,0:25:15.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没那么糟。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:13.33,0:25:15.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's not that bad.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:16.54,0:25:17.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}加油。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:16.54,0:25:17.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:39.67,0:25:40.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}（吸气）
Dialogue: 1,0:25:39.67,0:25:40.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}[inhales）
Dialogue: 2,0:26:01.62,0:26:04.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jon！咱们现在多高了？
Dialogue: 1,0:26:01.62,0:26:04.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jon! How high are we now?
Dialogue: 2,0:26:04.62,0:26:07.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}海拔快到4,000英尺了！
Dialogue: 1,0:26:04.62,0:26:07.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Almost 4,000 feet above sea level!
Dialogue: 2,0:26:07.50,0:26:09.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}卧槽！
Dialogue: 1,0:26:07.50,0:26:09.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 2,0:26:50.71,0:26:52.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}（尖叫）
Dialogue: 1,0:26:50.71,0:26:52.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}[screams）
Dialogue: 2,0:26:57.54,0:26:59.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你还好吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:26:57.54,0:26:59.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:16.04,0:27:17.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jon?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:16.04,0:27:17.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jon?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:19.00,0:27:20.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jon?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:19.00,0:27:20.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jon?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:20.79,0:27:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jon!
Dialogue: 1,0:27:20.79,0:27:21.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jon!
Dialogue: 2,0:27:21.96,0:27:23.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你马上就能穿过云层了！
Dialogue: 1,0:27:21.96,0:27:23.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You'll be through the clouds in a moment!
Dialogue: 2,0:27:23.83,0:27:27.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-接着往上爬就行。  -我什么都看不见。
Dialogue: 1,0:27:23.83,0:27:27.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Just keep climbing.   -I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:27.38,0:27:29.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}一步一步来！
Dialogue: 1,0:27:27.38,0:27:29.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}One step at a time!
Dialogue: 2,0:27:39.96,0:27:41.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax？抓住我的手！
Dialogue: 1,0:27:39.96,0:27:41.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jax? Grab my hand!
Dialogue: 2,0:27:46.83,0:27:48.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}现在，解开锁扣！
Dialogue: 1,0:27:46.83,0:27:48.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Now, unclip!
Dialogue: 2,0:28:01.04,0:28:03.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你还好吗？  -嗯。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:01.04,0:28:03.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You good?   -Yep.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:03.67,0:28:04.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}谢谢。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:03.67,0:28:04.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thanks.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:08.46,0:28:09.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:28:08.46,0:28:09.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:28:12.04,0:28:13.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}各位女士。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:12.04,0:28:13.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ladies.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:14.42,0:28:16.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}欢迎来走木板。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:14.42,0:28:16.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Welcome to the plank walk.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:24.04,0:28:26.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，就跟爬梯子一样，
Dialogue: 1,0:28:24.04,0:28:26.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, so, just like the laddering,
Dialogue: 2,0:28:26.29,0:28:27.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你要扣两个锁扣。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:26.29,0:28:27.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}you'll be double clipping.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:27.46,0:28:30.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，这次扣到这条安全链上。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:27.46,0:28:30.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Now, this time onto this safety chain.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:30.79,0:28:33.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你得保证一直扣着一个。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:30.79,0:28:33.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You need to make sure you're attached to one at all times.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:34.08,0:28:36.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}接下来，保险起见……
Dialogue: 1,0:28:34.08,0:28:36.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Now, for good measure...
Dialogue: 2,0:28:36.42,0:28:38.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我要把你扣上……
Dialogue: 1,0:28:36.42,0:28:38.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm gonna be clipping you...
Dialogue: 2,0:28:39.96,0:28:41.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}一起。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:39.96,0:28:41.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}together.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:45.04,0:28:47.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。那……
Dialogue: 1,0:28:45.04,0:28:47.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. So...
Dialogue: 2,0:28:48.67,0:28:50.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等你准备好了……
Dialogue: 1,0:28:48.67,0:28:50.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}When you're ready...
Dialogue: 2,0:29:02.04,0:29:04.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}深吸一口气……
Dialogue: 1,0:29:02.04,0:29:04.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Take a deep breath...
Dialogue: 2,0:29:04.04,0:29:05.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有……
Dialogue: 1,0:29:04.04,0:29:05.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and...
Dialogue: 2,0:29:11.17,0:29:13.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}扣上...
Dialogue: 1,0:29:11.17,0:29:13.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Clip in...
Dialogue: 2,0:29:13.17,0:29:14.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}脱扣。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:13.17,0:29:14.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}clip out.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:18.46,0:29:20.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}一步一步往前走。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:18.46,0:29:20.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}One foot in front of the other.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:22.08,0:29:23.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就这样。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:22.08,0:29:23.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Like so.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:31.17,0:29:33.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}扣上，解开。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:31.17,0:29:33.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Clip in, clip out.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:34.46,0:29:37.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好了，姑娘们，轮到你们了。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:34.46,0:29:37.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}There. You're up, ladies.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:37.12,0:29:39.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}咱们到底在干什么鬼？
Dialogue: 1,0:29:37.12,0:29:39.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What the hell are we doing?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:39.33,0:29:41.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没事，会很好玩的。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:39.33,0:29:41.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's okay. It'll be fun.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:42.33,0:29:45.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。就是……他说的，你懂吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:29:42.33,0:29:45.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah. Just... what he said, you know?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:50.54,0:29:53.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}一步一步往前走。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:50.54,0:29:53.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}One foot in front of the other.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:57.58,0:30:00.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}咱们当初干吗不干脆去玩水肺潜水？
Dialogue: 1,0:29:57.58,0:30:00.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Why didn't we just go scuba diving?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:00.04,0:30:01.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}鲨鱼？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:00.04,0:30:01.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sharks?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:19.21,0:30:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我的天。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:19.21,0:30:20.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:22.00,0:30:24.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没事。我来处理。没问题。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:22.00,0:30:24.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's okay. I'm on it. It's fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:28.08,0:30:29.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}大概4000英尺。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:28.08,0:30:29.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's about 4000 feet.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:30.71,0:30:32.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}搞什么鬼？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:30.71,0:30:32.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What the hell?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:40.83,0:30:42.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}说个有趣的事。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:40.83,0:30:42.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Fun fact.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:42.12,0:30:43.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这些木板最早是和尚搭的
Dialogue: 1,0:30:42.12,0:30:43.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Monks first built these planks
Dialogue: 2,0:30:43.67,0:30:46.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}为了在13世纪触到天空。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:43.67,0:30:46.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}to reach the heavens in the 13th century.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:46.79,0:30:48.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有些零件已经换过了。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:46.79,0:30:48.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Some parts have been replaced.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:48.96,0:30:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有些……呃，有些还没。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:48.96,0:30:52.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Some... eh, some haven't.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:58.12,0:30:59.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}搞定一个。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:58.12,0:30:59.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}One down.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:59.67,0:31:01.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就剩300了。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:59.67,0:31:01.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Only 300 more to go.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:02.29,0:31:04.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，接着走。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:02.29,0:31:04.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. On we go.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:19.21,0:31:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们快到Khao Sok Phee Sat了，
Dialogue: 1,0:31:19.21,0:31:22.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We are now approaching Khao Sok Phee Sat,
Dialogue: 2,0:31:22.12,0:31:24.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}也叫 The Devil's Elbow。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:22.12,0:31:24.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}AKA The Devil's Elbow.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:24.58,0:31:25.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好好看看风景吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:24.58,0:31:25.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Enjoy the view.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:35.00,0:31:37.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我的天啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:31:35.00,0:31:37.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Holy smokes.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:37.29,0:31:40.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这景色太壮观了。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:37.29,0:31:40.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This view is spectacular.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:40.33,0:31:42.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax，你可得看看这景色。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:40.33,0:31:42.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jax, you gotta check out this view.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:44.08,0:31:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哇。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:44.08,0:31:45.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wow.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:58.96,0:32:00.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:58.96,0:32:00.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}OK.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:03.88,0:32:06.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax Hunter， 跟屏幕前的观众说说吧
Dialogue: 1,0:32:03.88,0:32:06.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jax Hunter, why don't you tell the folks at home
Dialogue: 2,0:32:06.88,0:32:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这景色也太美了吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:32:06.88,0:32:09.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}how amazing is this view?
Dialogue: 2,0:32:09.50,0:32:11.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我觉得我会更享受这事儿
Dialogue: 1,0:32:09.50,0:32:11.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I feel like I would be enjoying it more
Dialogue: 2,0:32:11.46,0:32:13.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要不是我心里在尖叫。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:11.46,0:32:13.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}if I wasn't screaming inside.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:13.83,0:32:15.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}扫兴鬼。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:13.83,0:32:15.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sourpuss.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:16.79,0:32:17.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎，伙计们？
Dialogue: 1,0:32:16.79,0:32:17.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, guys?
Dialogue: 2,0:32:17.92,0:32:19.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我知道我说过让你看看风景，
Dialogue: 1,0:32:17.92,0:32:19.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I Know I said enjoy the view,
Dialogue: 2,0:32:19.21,0:32:20.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不过咱们边走边做，行吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:32:19.21,0:32:20.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}but how about we do it on the move, yeah?
Dialogue: 2,0:32:20.96,0:32:23.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-收起来。  -你真没劲。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:20.96,0:32:23.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Put it away.   -You are no fun.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:40.92,0:32:43.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这可不妙。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:40.92,0:32:43.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's not good.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:50.33,0:32:52.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}到那边咱们该扣在哪儿？
Dialogue: 1,0:32:50.33,0:32:52.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What are we supposed to be clipped into over there?
Dialogue: 2,0:32:54.38,0:32:57.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哥们，徒步碰上这个正常吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:32:54.38,0:32:57.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Is this a normal part of the hike, dude?
Dialogue: 2,0:32:57.21,0:32:59.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你看，就少了两条链子。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:57.21,0:32:59.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look, it's just a couple of chains missing.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:59.50,0:33:02.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等等，你是说咱们不用安全绳就走？
Dialogue: 1,0:32:59.50,0:33:02.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wait. Are you suggesting we go without safety ropes?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:02.46,0:33:04.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，就是走直线。
Dialogue: 1,0:33:02.46,0:33:04.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, it's just walkin' in a straight line.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:05.54,0:33:06.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我的天啊。
Dialogue: 1,0:33:05.54,0:33:06.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:08.29,0:33:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这也太疯狂了。
Dialogue: 1,0:33:08.29,0:33:09.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This is insane.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:16.50,0:33:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-好，交给我。  -你干嘛呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:33:16.50,0:33:18.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Okay, I'm on this.   -What are you doing?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:19.00,0:33:20.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jaxy，拿着这个。
Dialogue: 1,0:33:19.00,0:33:20.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hold this, Jaxy.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:33.92,0:33:35.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我靠，Luce！
Dialogue: 1,0:33:33.92,0:33:35.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Holy shit, Luce!
Dialogue: 2,0:33:36.21,0:33:39.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你找死啊？！  -怂包！
Dialogue: 1,0:33:36.21,0:33:39.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You got a death wish?!   -Pussy!
Dialogue: 2,0:33:39.54,0:33:41.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你疯了！
Dialogue: 1,0:33:39.54,0:33:41.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're cr az y!
Dialogue: 2,0:33:51.58,0:33:52.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:51.58,0:33:52.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jax?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:54.17,0:33:55.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax？
Dialogue: 1,0:33:54.17,0:33:55.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jax?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:55.71,0:33:57.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax!
Dialogue: 1,0:33:55.71,0:33:57.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jax!
Dialogue: 2,0:34:12.04,0:34:15.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Shi?!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:12.04,0:34:15.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shi?!
Dialogue: 2,0:34:15.88,0:34:17.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}靠！
Dialogue: 1,0:34:15.88,0:34:17.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shi!
Dialogue: 2,0:34:17.17,0:34:19.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Shi！Shi，搞什么鬼？！
Dialogue: 1,0:34:17.17,0:34:19.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shi! Shi, what the hell?!
Dialogue: 2,0:34:19.83,0:34:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}看着我！
Dialogue: 1,0:34:19.83,0:34:20.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look at me!
Dialogue: 2,0:34:25.25,0:34:26.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}- Jax！
Dialogue: 1,0:34:25.25,0:34:26.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}- Jax!
Dialogue: 2,0:34:26.50,0:34:28.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，嘿，嘿。看着我，看着我。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:26.50,0:34:28.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, hey, hey. Look at me, look at me.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:31.71,0:34:33.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax，看着我。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:31.71,0:34:33.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jax. Look at me.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:33.50,0:34:35.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你没事。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:33.50,0:34:35.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:35.38,0:34:36.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天哪，你刚才整个人都懵了。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:35.38,0:34:36.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jesus, you were out of it.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:36.96,0:34:39.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-她没事吧？！  -嗯，应该没事。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:36.96,0:34:39.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-ls she okay?!   -Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:39.33,0:34:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}只是海拔的关系。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:39.33,0:34:40.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's just the altitude.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:40.96,0:34:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这儿，行吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:34:40.96,0:34:42.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Here. Okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:44.79,0:34:46.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这个你只要一点就够了。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:44.79,0:34:46.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You just need some of this.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:48.96,0:34:50.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-深呼吸。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:48.96,0:34:50.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Deep breaths.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:50.67,0:34:52.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在……
Dialogue: 1,0:34:50.67,0:34:52.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}In...
Dialogue: 2,0:34:53.08,0:34:54.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}再来一个。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:53.08,0:34:54.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}One more.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:56.67,0:34:58.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}行吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:34:56.67,0:34:58.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:58.29,0:35:00.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-好点了吗？  -嗯。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:58.29,0:35:00.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Feel better?   -Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:01.17,0:35:03.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们快到了。你会没事的。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:01.17,0:35:03.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We're close now. You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:03.50,0:35:05.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你要是又觉得不舒服，哪怕只有一点，
Dialogue: 1,0:35:03.50,0:35:05.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Now, if you feel even slightly sick again,
Dialogue: 2,0:35:05.38,0:35:06.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就再吸一口吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:05.38,0:35:06.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}just take another hit.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:06.79,0:35:08.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}一点一点来，就没事。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:06.79,0:35:08.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}A little at a time and you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:08.83,0:35:10.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，谢谢。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:08.83,0:35:10.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:11.12,0:35:13.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我扔根绳子给你！  -好。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:11.12,0:35:13.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I'm gonna throw you a rope!   -Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:15.21,0:35:17.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，现在把它扣到链条上！
Dialogue: 1,0:35:15.21,0:35:17.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, now Clip it onto the chain!
Dialogue: 2,0:35:28.46,0:35:30.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我拉住你了。  -谢谢。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:28.46,0:35:30.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I got you.   -Thanks.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:33.92,0:35:35.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:35:33.92,0:35:35.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:35:35.12,0:35:37.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，刚才脱手了。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:35.12,0:35:37.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah. Just lost it.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:37.12,0:35:38.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-哇！  -没事。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:37.12,0:35:38.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Whoa!   -It's okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:38.54,0:35:40.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-就一会儿。  -没事。
Dialogue: 1,0:35:38.54,0:35:40.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-For a moment.   -It's alright.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:14.92,0:36:16.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jon，雨下得挺大。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:14.92,0:36:16.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jon, it's coming down pretty hard.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:16.79,0:36:19.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-咱们怎么办？  -继续走最稳妥。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:16.79,0:36:19.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-What should we do?   -Safest to keep moving.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:19.67,0:36:21.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们快到了。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:19.67,0:36:21.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We're almost there.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:47.08,0:36:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}解开锁扣，往后退！马上！
Dialogue: 1,0:36:47.08,0:36:49.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Unclip and get back! Now!
Dialogue: 2,0:36:49.92,0:36:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}地震了！
Dialogue: 1,0:36:49.92,0:36:51.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's an earthquake!
Dialogue: 2,0:36:56.25,0:36:57.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快，快，快！
Dialogue: 1,0:36:56.25,0:36:57.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 2,0:37:21.50,0:37:23.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在哪儿……他在哪儿？！
Dialogue: 1,0:37:21.50,0:37:23.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Where... where is he?!
Dialogue: 2,0:37:26.38,0:37:27.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jon!
Dialogue: 1,0:37:26.38,0:37:27.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jon!
Dialogue: 2,0:37:30.25,0:37:33.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-Jon!  -Jon!
Dialogue: 1,0:37:30.25,0:37:33.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Jon!   -Jon!
Dialogue: 2,0:37:33.21,0:37:36.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jon!
Dialogue: 1,0:37:33.21,0:37:36.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jon!
Dialogue: 2,0:37:40.00,0:37:41.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}咱们怎么办？
Dialogue: 1,0:37:40.00,0:37:41.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What do we do?
Dialogue: 2,0:37:43.42,0:37:45.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们得回去。
Dialogue: 1,0:37:43.42,0:37:45.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We have to go back.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:45.79,0:37:47.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们做不到！光靠我们不行。
Dialogue: 1,0:37:45.79,0:37:47.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We can't! Not on our own.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:48.00,0:37:49.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们不能待在这儿，Jax。
Dialogue: 1,0:37:48.00,0:37:49.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We can't stay here, Jax.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:49.50,0:37:51.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要是再地震怎么办？
Dialogue: 1,0:37:49.50,0:37:51.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What if there's another earthquake?
Dialogue: 2,0:37:52.92,0:37:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,0:37:52.92,0:37:54.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:54.12,0:37:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}咱们慢慢来就行。
Dialogue: 1,0:37:54.12,0:37:57.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We're just gonna take it slow.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:57.08,0:37:59.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}咱们会互相照应。
Dialogue: 1,0:37:57.08,0:37:59.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We're gonna look out for each other.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:59.33,0:38:01.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}扣上，解开。
Dialogue: 1,0:37:59.33,0:38:01.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Clip in, clip out.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:02.79,0:38:04.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}走吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:02.79,0:38:04.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Let's go.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:26.71,0:38:29.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}靠，Luce，我们没绳子！
Dialogue: 1,0:38:26.71,0:38:29.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shit, Luce, we don't have the rope!
Dialogue: 2,0:38:31.75,0:38:33.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我来领攀。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:31.75,0:38:33.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'll take the lead.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:33.21,0:38:34.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我做不到。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:33.21,0:38:34.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can't do it.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:34.71,0:38:37.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们没得选。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:34.71,0:38:37.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:45.88,0:38:48.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你做到过一次，还能再做到。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:45.88,0:38:48.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You did it once. You can do it again.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:49.29,0:38:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，我绕过来。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:49.29,0:38:51.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. Coming around.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:56.62,0:38:58.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-哇！  -跨过去。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:56.62,0:38:58.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Whoa!   -Step over.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:01.46,0:39:02.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}很简单。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:01.46,0:39:02.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Easy.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:04.17,0:39:05.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}行吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:39:04.17,0:39:05.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:39:13.88,0:39:15.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}加油，Jax。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:13.88,0:39:15.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on, Jax.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:15.67,0:39:17.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天啊。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:15.67,0:39:17.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:23.04,0:39:24.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你能行。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:23.04,0:39:24.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You got this.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:32.29,0:39:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:39:32.29,0:39:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 2,0:39:34.71,0:39:37.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}抓紧我。你能行。才十英尺。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:34.71,0:39:37.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hold on to me. You got this. It's only ten feet.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:59.83,0:40:02.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}干得漂亮，Jax！你就快到了！
Dialogue: 1,0:39:59.83,0:40:02.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're doing great, Jax! You're almost there!
Dialogue: 2,0:40:22.08,0:40:23.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我扣好了！我扣好了！
Dialogue: 1,0:40:22.08,0:40:23.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm clipped in! I'm clipped in!
Dialogue: 2,0:40:23.67,0:40:24.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我接住你了！
Dialogue: 1,0:40:23.67,0:40:24.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I got you!
Dialogue: 2,0:40:24.88,0:40:26.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你快到了。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:24.88,0:40:26.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're almost here.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:28.29,0:40:30.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快，Jax！抓住我的手。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:28.29,0:40:30.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on, Jax! Grab my hand.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:33.83,0:40:35.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我的天啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:40:33.83,0:40:35.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 2,0:40:35.58,0:40:38.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没事了。你现在安全了。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:35.58,0:40:38.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's okay. You're safe now.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:49.21,0:40:51.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你好，Devil's Elbow。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:49.21,0:40:51.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hello, Devil's Elbow.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:52.33,0:40:54.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，快到了。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:52.33,0:40:54.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. Almost there.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:55.00,0:40:56.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我看见了。梯子在那儿。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:55.00,0:40:56.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I see it. There's the ladder.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:11.83,0:41:14.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-哎，不、不、不、不、不、不！
Dialogue: 1,0:41:11.83,0:41:14.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 2,0:41:14.04,0:41:15.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不！不！
Dialogue: 1,0:41:14.04,0:41:15.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No! No!
Dialogue: 2,0:41:46.33,0:41:48.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我解不开锁扣！
Dialogue: 1,0:41:46.33,0:41:48.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can't unclip!
Dialogue: 2,0:42:11.83,0:42:13.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我的天哪！
Dialogue: 1,0:42:11.83,0:42:13.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 2,0:42:48.38,0:42:50.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}木板都没了。
Dialogue: 1,0:42:48.38,0:42:50.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The planks are gone.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:51.96,0:42:53.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}木板都没了。
Dialogue: 1,0:42:51.96,0:42:53.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The planks are gone.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:58.54,0:43:01.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天哪！我连安全带都没有！
Dialogue: 1,0:42:58.54,0:43:01.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, my God! And I don't even have a safety harness!
Dialogue: 2,0:43:03.75,0:43:06.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。行。我这边好了。我帮你固定。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:03.75,0:43:06.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. Alright. I got mine. I'll secure you.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:08.08,0:43:10.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我拉住你了。我拉住你了。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:08.08,0:43:10.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I got you. I got you.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:10.08,0:43:12.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-好了吗？  -好了。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:10.08,0:43:12.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Okay?   -Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:14.12,0:43:15.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，太好了。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:14.12,0:43:15.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, great.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:15.75,0:43:17.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:15.75,0:43:17.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Alright.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:18.62,0:43:19.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}小心。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:18.62,0:43:19.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Be careful.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:21.92,0:43:24.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}小心点。好。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:21.92,0:43:24.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Be careful. Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:24.62,0:43:28.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-电话！试试电话！  -好。行。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:24.62,0:43:28.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Phones! Try the phones!   -Okay. Alright.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:29.38,0:43:31.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我的天啊……
Dialogue: 1,0:43:29.38,0:43:31.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, my God...
Dialogue: 2,0:43:32.25,0:43:34.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！没信号……
Dialogue: 1,0:43:32.25,0:43:34.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh! No service...
Dialogue: 2,0:43:34.33,0:43:35.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就等于没翻译员！
Dialogue: 1,0:43:34.33,0:43:35.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}equals no translator!
Dialogue: 2,0:43:35.92,0:43:37.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，我这儿有一格信号！
Dialogue: 1,0:43:35.92,0:43:37.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, I have one bar!
Dialogue: 2,0:43:38.00,0:43:39.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}泰国版的911是多少？
Dialogue: 1,0:43:38.00,0:43:39.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What's the number for 911 in Thailand?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:40.00,0:43:42.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}1-9-1.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:40.00,0:43:42.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}1-9-1.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:43.62,0:43:45.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-响了。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:43.62,0:43:45.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-It's ringing.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:47.42,0:43:50.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你好。嗨。我们在 Mount Kwan 上。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:47.42,0:43:50.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hello. Hi. We're on Mount Kwan.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:50.54,0:43:53.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们被困在Devil's Elbow的木板上了。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:50.54,0:43:53.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We're trapped on the planks of the Devil's Elbow.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:53.42,0:43:55.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们需要帮忙！你听懂了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:43:53.42,0:43:55.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We need help! Do you understand?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:56.25,0:43:58.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不好意思，我不会说泰语。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:56.25,0:43:58.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm sorry, I don't speak Thai.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:59.88,0:44:01.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不好意思，我不会说泰语。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:59.88,0:44:01.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sorry. No Thai.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:01.33,0:44:03.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我试试找我妈。  -等等。
Dialogue: 1,0:44:01.33,0:44:03.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I'll try my mom.   -Wait.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:03.33,0:44:05.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}希望你们的服务也覆盖国外。
Dialogue: 1,0:44:03.33,0:44:05.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm hoping you have international coverage.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:08.67,0:44:10.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-没信号！  -靠！
Dialogue: 1,0:44:08.67,0:44:10.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-No service!   -Shit!
Dialogue: 2,0:44:14.71,0:44:16.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}救命！
Dialogue: 1,0:44:14.71,0:44:16.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Help!
Dialogue: 2,0:44:23.88,0:44:27.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-救命！  -救命！
Dialogue: 1,0:44:23.88,0:44:27.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Help!   -Help!
Dialogue: 2,0:44:27.46,0:44:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}帮帮我们！
Dialogue: 1,0:44:27.46,0:44:29.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Help us!
Dialogue: 2,0:45:20.96,0:45:22.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等一下。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:20.96,0:45:22.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hold on.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:23.75,0:45:24.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:23.75,0:45:24.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Alright.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:24.96,0:45:28.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}两边各有大概50英尺的木板全毁了。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:24.96,0:45:28.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The planks are destroyed, like, 50 feet on both sides.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:28.46,0:45:30.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就剩些零零散散的支架和木板了
Dialogue: 1,0:45:28.46,0:45:30.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What's left are random brackets and planks
Dialogue: 2,0:45:30.83,0:45:34.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可咱连个能借力爬出去的东西都没有。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:30.83,0:45:34.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}but nothing to climb our asses on out of here with.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:43.71,0:45:46.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哥们，你的对讲机。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:43.71,0:45:46.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Dude. Your radio.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:46.17,0:45:48.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还在你背包上呢。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:46.17,0:45:48.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's still on your backpack.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:49.79,0:45:52.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}大概有20英尺远吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:45:49.79,0:45:52.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's, like, 20-ish feet away?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:52.88,0:45:54.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}跟在月球上没两样。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:52.88,0:45:54.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}May as well be on the moon.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:02.17,0:46:03.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你还好吗？  -嗯。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:02.17,0:46:03.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You okay?   -Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:06.83,0:46:08.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}会有人找到我们的，Jax。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:06.83,0:46:08.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Someone's gonna find us, Jax.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:09.00,0:46:10.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我保证。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:09.00,0:46:10.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I promise.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:12.50,0:46:14.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不可能。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:12.50,0:46:14.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No way.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:14.58,0:46:16.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-等等。  -什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:14.58,0:46:16.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Wait.   -What?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:16.21,0:46:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你看。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:16.21,0:46:17.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:18.25,0:46:20.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-那是……？  -哥们，那是酒吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:18.25,0:46:20.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Is that...?   -Dude, it's the bar.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:20.25,0:46:22.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-才怪。  -那是咱们的酒吧！
Dialogue: 1,0:46:20.25,0:46:22.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-As if.   -It's our bar!
Dialogue: 2,0:46:22.67,0:46:23.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，就是这个！
Dialogue: 1,0:46:22.67,0:46:23.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, that's it!
Dialogue: 2,0:46:24.58,0:46:27.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没准能让他们注意到咱们什么的。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:24.58,0:46:27.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Maybe we can get their attention or something.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:27.46,0:46:28.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，怎么做？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:27.46,0:46:28.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah. How?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:31.38,0:46:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}激光笔。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:31.38,0:46:32.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The laser pointer.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:32.92,0:46:35.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是从Jon那儿抢过来的。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:32.92,0:46:35.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I snatched it off of Jon.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:35.42,0:46:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，对！能到那么远吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:35.42,0:46:37.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, yes! Will it go that far?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:38.75,0:46:41.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，他昨晚指给我们看那座山。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:38.75,0:46:41.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, he pointed out the mountain to us last night.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:42.79,0:46:46.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我看不见。可能颜色太浅了。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:42.79,0:46:46.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't see it. Maybe it's too light.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:46.25,0:46:48.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}说不定只有在黑暗里才管用。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:46.25,0:46:48.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Maybe it'll only work in the dark.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:51.00,0:46:52.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们得等到那时候。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:51.00,0:46:52.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We'll have to wait till then.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:18.08,0:47:20.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们压根就不该上来。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:18.08,0:47:20.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We shouldn't even be up here.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:22.75,0:47:25.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Shi压根就不该上那座塔。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:22.75,0:47:25.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shi shouldn't even have been up that tower.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:26.12,0:47:28.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你什么意思？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:26.12,0:47:28.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:28.12,0:47:30.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她本不该在上面。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:28.12,0:47:30.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She wasn't supposed to be up there.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:32.08,0:47:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们本来该一起玩的。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:32.08,0:47:34.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We were supposed to be hanging out.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:34.92,0:47:36.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可Becky需要她。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:34.92,0:47:36.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But Becky needed her.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:37.92,0:47:39.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}接着，Shi跑了过来。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:37.92,0:47:39.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And Shi came running.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:42.00,0:47:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她总是选Becky，不选我。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:42.00,0:47:44.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She always chose Becky over me.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:44.12,0:47:46.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我敢肯定，事情其实不是那样。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:44.12,0:47:46.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm sure that's not really the case.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:46.38,0:47:48.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Shiloh真的很爱你。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:46.38,0:47:48.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shiloh really loved you.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:54.62,0:47:56.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那是疤吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:54.62,0:47:56.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Is that a scar?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:56.67,0:47:58.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}太疯狂了，对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:56.67,0:47:58.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's crazy, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:58.12,0:47:59.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}卧槽。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:58.12,0:47:59.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:01.21,0:48:03.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没什么。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:01.21,0:48:03.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's nothing.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:10.17,0:48:12.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Luce？Jax？收到请回答！
Dialogue: 1,0:48:10.17,0:48:12.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Luce? Jax? Come in!
Dialogue: 2,0:48:12.75,0:48:14.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-天啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:48:12.75,0:48:14.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 2,0:48:14.17,0:48:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-Jon！  -他还活着！
Dialogue: 1,0:48:14.17,0:48:15.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Jon!   -He's alive!
Dialogue: 2,0:48:15.96,0:48:17.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}能听见我吗？有人吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:15.96,0:48:17.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Can you read me? Anyone?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:17.79,0:48:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他还活着！
Dialogue: 1,0:48:17.79,0:48:19.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}He's alive!
Dialogue: 2,0:48:19.17,0:48:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}能听见我说话就请回个话。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:19.17,0:48:20.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}/f you can hear me, please respond.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:22.21,0:48:23.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}山上滚下的石头把我砸晕了。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:22.21,0:48:23.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The rock slide knocked me unconscious.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:23.71,0:48:25.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}把Myanmar路线彻底去掉了。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:23.71,0:48:25.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Completely took out the Myanmar route.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:25.50,0:48:28.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我没法从那边下去。那儿跟战场似的。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:25.50,0:48:28.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can't get down that way. It's like a war zone.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:28.21,0:48:31.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}喂，能听见我的话，请回一声。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:28.21,0:48:31.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look, if you can hear me, please respond.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:31.12,0:48:34.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哥们，对讲机就在那儿！
Dialogue: 1,0:48:31.12,0:48:34.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The radio is right there, man!
Dialogue: 2,0:48:34.12,0:48:36.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}伙计们，能听见我吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:34.12,0:48:36.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Guys, can you read me?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:36.79,0:48:38.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}靠。咱们怎么才能……？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:36.79,0:48:38.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shit. How can we...?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:38.79,0:48:41.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要不咱们掀起一截木板什么的？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:38.79,0:48:41.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Maybe if we, like, take up some of the plank or something
Dialogue: 2,0:48:41.83,0:48:43.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}再把它当棍子用？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:41.83,0:48:43.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and use it as a stick?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:43.08,0:48:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}绳子。我们可以用绳子套住它。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:43.08,0:48:46.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}A rope. We could lasso it.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:46.12,0:48:47.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}够得着吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:46.12,0:48:47.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Could it reach?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:47.33,0:48:49.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}试了才知道。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:47.33,0:48:49.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Only one way to find out.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:49.33,0:48:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}姑娘们，你们在吗？求你们接电话。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:49.33,0:48:51.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Girls, please, are you there? Pick up.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:56.54,0:48:57.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:56.54,0:48:57.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:59.79,0:49:01.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}抓住这个。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:59.79,0:49:01.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Grab this.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:04.54,0:49:05.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}来吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:04.54,0:49:05.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:05.79,0:49:08.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哥们，我看这不够长。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:05.79,0:49:08.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Dude, I don't think it's gonna be long enough.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:14.50,0:49:17.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃……有了，有了，有了！ 等等，等等，等等。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:14.50,0:49:17.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh... idea, idea, idea! Hold, hold, hold.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:18.38,0:49:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}说不定刚够咱们施展。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:18.38,0:49:20.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Might just give us enough to play with.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:25.96,0:49:28.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。嗯。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:25.96,0:49:28.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Alright. Yep.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:28.71,0:49:30.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，就在这条岩棱上。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:28.71,0:49:30.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, on this edge.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:30.96,0:49:34.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这样地方应该够我们用了。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:30.96,0:49:34.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This should give us enough room.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:34.42,0:49:36.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-这应该行。  -太好了。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:34.42,0:49:36.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-This should work.   -Great.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:37.21,0:49:39.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那个……
Dialogue: 1,0:49:37.21,0:49:39.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That one...
Dialogue: 2,0:49:39.12,0:49:40.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:39.12,0:49:40.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Alright.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:41.71,0:49:44.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。小心点。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:41.71,0:49:44.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. Be careful.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:49.42,0:49:51.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没事，再试一次。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:49.42,0:49:51.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's okay. Try again.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:52.08,0:49:53.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我再靠近一点。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:52.08,0:49:53.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Let me get a little bit closer.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:01.46,0:50:03.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}再近一点就行。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:01.46,0:50:03.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Just need to be a little closer.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:04.58,0:50:06.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-Luce……  -好近啊。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:04.58,0:50:06.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Luce...   -It's so close.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:06.46,0:50:08.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-来，抓紧我。  -什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:06.46,0:50:08.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Here, hold on to me.   -What?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:08.67,0:50:10.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}抓紧我的腰带。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:08.67,0:50:10.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hold on to my belt.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:10.29,0:50:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎哎哎哎！哎，等等。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:10.29,0:50:13.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa! Whoa, wait.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:13.08,0:50:14.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-拉住我了吗？  -嗯。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:13.08,0:50:14.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You got me?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:14.96,0:50:16.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我试着迈一步。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:14.96,0:50:16.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm gonna try and step.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:16.75,0:50:18.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真的吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:16.75,0:50:18.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Really?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:18.67,0:50:21.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎！Luce！别！别 别别！这主意太糟了。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:18.67,0:50:21.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Whoa! Luce! No! No, no, no! Bad idea.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:25.92,0:50:27.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我靠一下，行吗？  -啊？不行。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:25.92,0:50:27.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I'm gonna lean, okay?   -Huh? No.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:27.58,0:50:29.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我要往后靠了。抓紧我。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:27.58,0:50:29.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm gonna lean. Hold on to me.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:29.42,0:50:31.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就几英寸，行吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:29.42,0:50:31.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's just a few inches. Alright?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:31.29,0:50:33.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}抓紧我。我能行。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:31.29,0:50:33.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hold on to me. I can do this.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:35.54,0:50:37.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天哪。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:35.54,0:50:37.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, gosh.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:38.08,0:50:41.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦……不、不、不，我不喜欢。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:38.08,0:50:41.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oooh... no, no, no. I don't like it.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:41.79,0:50:45.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-别松手，好吗？  -不会，不会。你快点。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:41.79,0:50:45.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Don't let go of me, okay?   -I won't, I won't. Just hurry.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:45.75,0:50:47.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}- 好 -啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:50:45.75,0:50:47.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}- Okay -Ahh!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:01.46,0:51:02.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:01.46,0:51:02.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:05.08,0:51:07.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Luce，求你快点。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:05.08,0:51:07.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Please, be quick, Luce.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:07.42,0:51:10.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我……怕是拉不住你多久了。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:07.42,0:51:10.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I... don't think I can hold you much longer.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:11.04,0:51:12.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊——！
Dialogue: 1,0:51:11.04,0:51:12.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ahhh!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:14.04,0:51:16.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，我知道了！好！
Dialogue: 1,0:51:14.04,0:51:16.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Alright, I got it! Okay!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:16.25,0:51:17.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，收绳。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:16.25,0:51:17.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, pull it in.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:18.54,0:51:20.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这得用点巧劲。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:18.54,0:51:20.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's gonna take a little bit of finessing.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:20.33,0:51:22.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}拜托了，Luce。求你了。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:20.33,0:51:22.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on, Luce. Please.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:23.08,0:51:24.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}请快点。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:23.08,0:51:24.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Please be quick.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:25.33,0:51:27.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！拜托快点！
Dialogue: 1,0:51:25.33,0:51:27.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh! Please be quick!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:27.08,0:51:28.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊啊啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:51:27.08,0:51:28.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ahhh!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:28.62,0:51:30.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊啊啊！啊，哈，哈！
Dialogue: 1,0:51:28.62,0:51:30.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ahhhh! Ah, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:30.33,0:51:33.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}来啊，你个狗娘养的！
Dialogue: 1,0:51:30.33,0:51:33.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:34.04,0:51:36.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我靠！好，我搞定了！
Dialogue: 1,0:51:34.04,0:51:36.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Holy shit! Alright, I got it!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:36.04,0:51:37.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-挂上了！  -好！
Dialogue: 1,0:51:36.04,0:51:37.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-It's hooked on!   -Yes!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:37.54,0:51:39.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-收绳，收绳。  -好。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:37.54,0:51:39.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Bring it in, bring it in.   -Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:39.92,0:51:41.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快点吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:39.92,0:51:41.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Please hurry.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:43.75,0:51:45.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}一点都不动！
Dialogue: 1,0:51:43.75,0:51:45.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's not budging!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:47.00,0:51:48.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}拜托！求你了！
Dialogue: 1,0:51:47.00,0:51:48.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on! Please!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:48.12,0:51:50.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}来啊，你个狗娘养的。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:48.12,0:51:50.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:50.21,0:51:51.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎哟！
Dialogue: 1,0:51:50.21,0:51:51.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ow!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:57.12,0:51:58.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎哟！求你了，求你了，求你了！
Dialogue: 1,0:51:57.12,0:51:58.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ow! Please, please, please!
Dialogue: 2,0:52:05.17,0:52:07.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}操！
Dialogue: 1,0:52:05.17,0:52:07.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shit!
Dialogue: 2,0:52:07.04,0:52:08.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们就差一点了！
Dialogue: 1,0:52:07.04,0:52:08.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We were so close!
Dialogue: 2,0:52:08.71,0:52:10.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:52:08.71,0:52:10.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Arggh!
Dialogue: 2,0:52:10.54,0:52:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没事，咱们可以试试别的。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:10.54,0:52:13.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's okay. We can try something else.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:13.79,0:52:14.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}用什么？！
Dialogue: 1,0:52:13.79,0:52:14.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}With what?!
Dialogue: 2,0:52:14.96,0:52:17.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们的绳子用完了！
Dialogue: 1,0:52:14.96,0:52:17.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We don't have any more rope left!
Dialogue: 2,0:52:20.58,0:52:21.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对不起。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:20.58,0:52:21.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:26.88,0:52:29.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-还是用A方案。  -好。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:26.88,0:52:29.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Back to plan A.   -Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:37.71,0:52:38.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那他妈是什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:52:37.71,0:52:38.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 2,0:52:39.88,0:52:42.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快啊，拜托，拜托， 拜托，谁能看见我啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:52:39.88,0:52:42.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on, please, please, please, somebody see.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:42.04,0:52:44.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就保持在那儿。对，很好。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:42.04,0:52:44.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Keep it there. Yes, good.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:52.92,0:52:54.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}来个人把那该死的卷帘拉下来。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:52.92,0:52:54.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Someone roll down that goddamn blind.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:54.83,0:52:56.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我想抓住这次机会。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:54.83,0:52:56.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm trying to take my shot.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:56.33,0:52:57.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}马上关上！
Dialogue: 1,0:52:56.33,0:52:57.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Close it now!
Dialogue: 2,0:53:07.88,0:53:09.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天哪！有人来了！
Dialogue: 1,0:53:07.88,0:53:09.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, my God! Someone's coming!
Dialogue: 2,0:53:09.08,0:53:10.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，开灯，开灯。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:09.08,0:53:10.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, turn on the light, turn on the light.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:10.58,0:53:12.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。加油，加油，加油。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:10.58,0:53:12.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:15.08,0:53:17.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我靠！是咱们要找的那个酒保。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:15.08,0:53:17.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Holy shit! It's our guy, the bartender.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:17.04,0:53:18.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-嗯，嗯。  -好，好。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:17.04,0:53:18.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Yeah, yeah.   -Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:22.33,0:53:24.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他在看吗？我看不出来。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:22.33,0:53:24.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Is he looking? I can't tell.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:24.21,0:53:26.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快点，快点，快点！拜托了！
Dialogue: 1,0:53:24.21,0:53:26.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on, come on, come on! Please!
Dialogue: 2,0:53:27.46,0:53:30.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}来个人把百叶窗拉上！我马上拍了。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:27.46,0:53:30.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Someone close the blinds! I'm about to take the shot.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:31.92,0:53:33.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等等，什么？他把窗帘拉上了。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:31.92,0:53:33.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wait, what? He shut the blind.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:33.75,0:53:35.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，不，不，不！
Dialogue: 1,0:53:33.75,0:53:35.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 2,0:53:35.83,0:53:37.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不！
Dialogue: 1,0:53:35.83,0:53:37.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No!
Dialogue: 2,0:53:40.08,0:53:41.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}该死！
