Dialogue: 2,0:58:58.92,0:59:01.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等等，你不用这么做。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:58.92,0:59:01.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wait, you don't have to.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:07.00,0:59:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我愿意。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:07.00,0:59:08.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I do.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:09.25,0:59:11.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}都怪我，咱们才会在这上头。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:09.25,0:59:11.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's my fault that we're up here.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:11.96,0:59:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}来，拿着这个。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:11.96,0:59:13.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Here. Hold this.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:30.38,0:59:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}能听见我，就请回个话。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:30.38,0:59:32.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}/f you can hear me, please respond.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:32.12,0:59:33.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax!
Dialogue: 1,0:59:32.12,0:59:33.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jax!
Dialogue: 2,0:59:33.92,0:59:35.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax? Luce?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:33.92,0:59:35.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jax? Luce?
Dialogue: 2,0:59:40.21,0:59:42.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听得见我说话的话，请吱一声。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:40.21,0:59:42.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Please let me know you can hear me.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:53.00,0:59:54.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Luce.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:53.00,0:59:54.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Luce.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:10.58,1:00:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}喔！
Dialogue: 1,1:00:10.58,1:00:11.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Whoo!
Dialogue: 2,1:00:13.92,1:00:15.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你能行。继续。
Dialogue: 1,1:00:13.92,1:00:15.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You got this. Keep going.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:45.38,1:00:47.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}来了，来了！
Dialogue: 1,1:00:45.38,1:00:47.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm coming, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 2,1:00:51.21,1:00:52.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}来了！来了！来了！
Dialogue: 1,1:00:51.21,1:00:52.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm coming! I'm coming! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 2,1:00:52.67,1:00:56.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-抓紧！抓紧！
Dialogue: 1,1:00:52.67,1:00:56.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Hold on! Hold on!
Dialogue: 2,1:00:57.75,1:00:59.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎哟——！
Dialogue: 1,1:00:57.75,1:00:59.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeeoooww!
Dialogue: 2,1:01:23.12,1:01:27.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。听我说！接住绳子！
Dialogue: 1,1:01:23.12,1:01:27.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. Listen to me! Catch the rope!
Dialogue: 2,1:01:27.17,1:01:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-Jax，我不行！  -你行的！
Dialogue: 1,1:01:27.17,1:01:30.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Jax, I can't!   -Yes, you can!
Dialogue: 2,1:01:30.17,1:01:32.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}三、二、一！
Dialogue: 1,1:01:30.17,1:01:32.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Three, two, one!
Dialogue: 2,1:01:34.46,1:01:36.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax!
Dialogue: 1,1:01:34.46,1:01:36.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jax!
Dialogue: 2,1:01:42.67,1:01:45.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没事。我再扔一次，行吗？！
Dialogue: 1,1:01:42.67,1:01:45.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's okay. I'm gonna throw it again, okay?!
Dialogue: 2,1:01:45.29,1:01:46.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我做不到，Jax！
Dialogue: 1,1:01:45.29,1:01:46.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can't do it, Jax!
Dialogue: 2,1:01:46.88,1:01:49.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你不许把我一个人丢在这上面，好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:01:46.88,1:01:49.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're not allowed to leave me up here alone, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:01:49.62,1:01:51.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}三、二、一！
Dialogue: 1,1:01:49.62,1:01:51.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Three, two, one!
Dialogue: 2,1:01:53.42,1:01:56.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对对对！把它扣在你腰带上！
Dialogue: 1,1:01:53.42,1:01:56.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yes, yes, yes! Clip it to your belt!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:02.08,1:02:03.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不！
Dialogue: 1,1:02:02.08,1:02:03.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:07.12,1:02:08.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:02:07.12,1:02:08.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Arggh!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:13.71,1:02:15.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:02:13.71,1:02:15.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Arggh!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:17.75,1:02:19.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:02:17.75,1:02:19.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Arggh!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:36.00,1:02:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-天哪。  -啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:02:36.00,1:02:38.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Oh, God.   -Arggh!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:38.12,1:02:39.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们得止血。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:38.12,1:02:39.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We need to stop the bleeding.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:39.75,1:02:41.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:02:39.75,1:02:41.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Arggh!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:46.00,1:02:47.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-啊啊啊！  -好，好。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:46.00,1:02:47.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Argghhh!   -Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:47.50,1:02:49.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对不起，对不起，对不起，对不起。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:47.50,1:02:49.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:49.33,1:02:52.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-啊！靠！好疼！  -我知道，我知道，我知道。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:49.33,1:02:52.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Arggh! Damn it! It hurts!   -I know, I know, I know.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:52.58,1:02:53.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这可能会疼。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:52.58,1:02:53.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This might hurt.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:02.54,1:03:04.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:03:02.54,1:03:04.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Arggh!
Dialogue: 2,1:03:04.21,1:03:05.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，慢慢呼吸。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:04.21,1:03:05.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, breathe slowly.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:05.88,1:03:07.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-慢点。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:05.88,1:03:07.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Slowly.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:07.04,1:03:08.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-在...
Dialogue: 1,1:03:07.04,1:03:08.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-In...
Dialogue: 2,1:03:08.75,1:03:11.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-……完毕。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:08.75,1:03:11.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-...and out.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:25.75,1:03:28.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对不起，我撒谎了。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:25.75,1:03:28.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm sorry for lying.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:28.92,1:03:30.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我……
Dialogue: 1,1:03:28.92,1:03:30.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I...
Dialogue: 2,1:03:30.88,1:03:34.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我不想死。  -你不会死的。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:30.88,1:03:34.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I don't wanna die.   -You're not going to die.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:34.25,1:03:36.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我是。  -不，你不是。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:34.25,1:03:36.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-l am.   -No, you're not.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:36.12,1:03:38.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax，你根本没在听！
Dialogue: 1,1:03:36.12,1:03:38.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're not listening, Jax!
Dialogue: 2,1:03:44.58,1:03:46.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我得了癌症。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:44.58,1:03:46.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I have cancer.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:50.12,1:03:52.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那道疤其实就是这么回事。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:50.12,1:03:52.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's what the scar actually is.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:55.08,1:03:57.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天啊……
Dialogue: 1,1:03:55.08,1:03:57.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}God...
Dialogue: 2,1:04:00.92,1:04:02.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-能帮我拿一下手机吗？  -嗯。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:00.92,1:04:02.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Can you get my phone for me?   -Mm.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:06.04,1:04:07.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我一直没接她的电话。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:06.04,1:04:07.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I've been ignoring her calls.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:08.83,1:04:10.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我妈真可怜。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:08.83,1:04:10.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}My poor mom.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:10.29,1:04:14.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不敢跟她说，我已经停了治疗。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:10.29,1:04:14.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can't face telling her that I've stopped treatment.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:16.17,1:04:18.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我也知道她担心得很。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:16.17,1:04:18.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And I know she's so worried.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:22.38,1:04:25.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我写了条短信，可……
Dialogue: 1,1:04:22.38,1:04:25.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I wrote a text, but...
Dialogue: 2,1:04:25.12,1:04:27.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我实在没力气爬完那条线。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:25.12,1:04:27.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I didn't have it in me to send it.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:32.00,1:04:34.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这下她永远都不会知道了。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:32.00,1:04:34.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And now she'll never know.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:34.25,1:04:36.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，听我说。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:34.25,1:04:36.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, listen to me.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:36.08,1:04:37.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们一定能下去。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:36.08,1:04:37.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We're gonna make it down.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:37.79,1:04:40.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}然后你要当面把这话告诉她。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:37.79,1:04:40.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And you are going to tell her that in person.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:40.04,1:04:41.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}行吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:04:40.04,1:04:41.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:41.25,1:04:43.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们一定能活着出去。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:41.25,1:04:43.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We are gonna make it out of here alive.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:43.08,1:04:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:43.08,1:04:44.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Mmm.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:06.67,1:05:09.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Shi! Shi!
Dialogue: 1,1:05:06.67,1:05:09.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shi! Shi!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:11.29,1:05:14.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}醒醒！Shi？
Dialogue: 1,1:05:11.29,1:05:14.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wake up! Shi?
Dialogue: 2,1:05:14.21,1:05:16.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Shi，醒醒！
Dialogue: 1,1:05:14.21,1:05:16.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shi, wake up!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:17.92,1:05:19.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Shi，醒醒！
Dialogue: 1,1:05:17.92,1:05:19.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shi, wake up!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:20.75,1:05:22.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Shi，快醒醒！
Dialogue: 1,1:05:20.75,1:05:22.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shi, wake up now!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:22.71,1:05:25.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}求你醒醒！
Dialogue: 1,1:05:22.71,1:05:25.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wake up, please!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:36.29,1:05:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快放我下去！
Dialogue: 1,1:05:36.29,1:05:38.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Get me down now!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:39.00,1:05:40.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你没事。
Dialogue: 1,1:05:39.00,1:05:40.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:41.42,1:05:44.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}搞什么鬼？！你个混蛋！
Dialogue: 1,1:05:41.42,1:05:44.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What the hell?! You're an asshole!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:44.04,1:05:45.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我还以为我要死了！
Dialogue: 1,1:05:44.04,1:05:45.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I thought I was going to die!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:45.46,1:05:47.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax！Jax，快点啊，哥们儿！
Dialogue: 1,1:05:45.46,1:05:47.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jax! Jax, come on, dude!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:47.58,1:05:49.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等等我！我只是想帮你！
Dialogue: 1,1:05:47.58,1:05:49.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wait up! I was just trying to help you!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:50.54,1:05:52.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}把我吓个半死，能帮我什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:05:50.54,1:05:52.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}How does scaring the hell out of me help me?
Dialogue: 2,1:05:52.46,1:05:54.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我想让你看看那种恐惧
Dialogue: 1,1:05:52.46,1:05:54.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I wanted to show you that fear
Dialogue: 2,1:05:54.04,1:05:55.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是你能控制的！
Dialogue: 1,1:05:54.04,1:05:55.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}is something that you can control!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:55.46,1:05:57.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}别再想着改变我了！行吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:05:55.46,1:05:57.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Stop trying to change me! Okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:05:57.62,1:06:00.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我又不是你的追随者，不用你救！
Dialogue: 1,1:05:57.62,1:06:00.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm not one of your followers. I don't need saving!
Dialogue: 2,1:06:01.79,1:06:02.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我爱你。
Dialogue: 1,1:06:01.79,1:06:02.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I love you.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:03.00,1:06:04.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，我要你停下
Dialogue: 1,1:06:03.00,1:06:04.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, I want you to stop
Dialogue: 2,1:06:04.62,1:06:06.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}任谁都能欺负你。
Dialogue: 1,1:06:04.62,1:06:06.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}letting everybody walk all over you.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:06.25,1:06:07.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么？像你一样？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:06.25,1:06:07.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What? Like you?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:08.00,1:06:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不。
Dialogue: 1,1:06:08.00,1:06:09.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No.
