Dialogue: 2,1:15:24.54,1:15:26.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他们正给我们派直升机。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:24.54,1:15:26.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}They're sending us a helicopter.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:27.96,1:15:29.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好了，他们会在山顶跟我们碰头。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:27.96,1:15:29.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}There you go. They're gonna meet us at the peak.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:29.88,1:15:32.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那我们只要过去等着就行。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:29.88,1:15:32.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So just have to make our way there and wait.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:32.38,1:15:33.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:15:32.38,1:15:33.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:15:33.67,1:15:35.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}走吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:33.67,1:15:35.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Let's go.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:45.29,1:15:47.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}记得扣上，也记得解开。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:45.29,1:15:47.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Remember to clip in and clip out.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:48.92,1:15:50.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:48.92,1:15:50.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yes.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:51.04,1:15:54.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:51.04,1:15:54.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:58.12,1:16:00.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，哇。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:58.12,1:16:00.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:04.33,1:16:06.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道吧，听说等你到了龙跟前……
Dialogue: 1,1:16:04.33,1:16:06.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know, they say when you reach the dragon...
Dialogue: 2,1:16:06.67,1:16:08.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}它会吃掉你的恐惧？
Dialogue: 1,1:16:06.67,1:16:08.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It eats your fears?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:04.96,1:17:06.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}爱你，Shi。
Dialogue: 1,1:17:04.96,1:17:06.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Love you, Shi.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:28.58,1:17:29.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}最后一次横渡。
Dialogue: 1,1:17:28.58,1:17:29.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Final crossing.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:33.04,1:17:34.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}撑不住太重的分量，
Dialogue: 1,1:17:33.04,1:17:34.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Can't take too much weight,
Dialogue: 2,1:17:34.50,1:17:36.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}所以我们得一个一个走。
Dialogue: 1,1:17:34.50,1:17:36.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}so we have to go one at a time.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:38.62,1:17:40.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我先来。
Dialogue: 1,1:17:38.62,1:17:40.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'll go first.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:45.79,1:17:48.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}- 天哪，Jon！
Dialogue: 1,1:17:45.79,1:17:48.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}- Jesus, Jon!
Dialogue: 2,1:17:48.08,1:17:49.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}稳住就行，好吗，Luce？
Dialogue: 1,1:17:48.08,1:17:49.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Just keep it together, okay, Luce?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:49.75,1:17:52.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可能坏了，可就差40英尺就自由了。
Dialogue: 1,1:17:49.75,1:17:52.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It might be damaged, but it's just 40 feet and then freedom.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:59.96,1:18:01.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-这也太疯狂了。  -嗯，慢点。
Dialogue: 1,1:17:59.96,1:18:01.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-This is crazy.   -Yeah. Go slow.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:16.58,1:18:18.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，没问题。
Dialogue: 1,1:18:16.58,1:18:18.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yep. You're good.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:45.12,1:18:47.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax，加油！
Dialogue: 1,1:18:45.12,1:18:47.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on, Jax!
Dialogue: 2,1:19:06.54,1:19:08.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这也太疯狂了。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:06.54,1:19:08.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:11.67,1:19:13.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你能行！
Dialogue: 1,1:19:11.67,1:19:13.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You got it!
Dialogue: 2,1:19:31.79,1:19:32.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:19:31.79,1:19:32.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ahh!
Dialogue: 2,1:19:32.88,1:19:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎，哎，哎！
Dialogue: 1,1:19:32.88,1:19:34.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 2,1:19:34.92,1:19:36.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-Jax!  -哦！
Dialogue: 1,1:19:34.92,1:19:36.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Jax!   -Oh!
Dialogue: 2,1:19:36.21,1:19:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Jax!
Dialogue: 1,1:19:36.21,1:19:38.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jax!
Dialogue: 2,1:19:40.00,1:19:41.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-要掉下来了！  -Jax，快！
Dialogue: 1,1:19:40.00,1:19:41.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-It's coming down!   -Jax, come on!
Dialogue: 2,1:19:41.50,1:19:43.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-Jax！  -快跑！
Dialogue: 1,1:19:41.50,1:19:43.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Jax!   -Run!
Dialogue: 2,1:19:49.38,1:19:51.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-谢谢。  -不客气。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:49.38,1:19:51.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Thanks.   -You're welcome.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:52.08,1:19:53.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，咱们快到了。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:52.08,1:19:53.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, we're almost there.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:53.79,1:19:55.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}咱们就歇一会儿，行吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:19:53.79,1:19:55.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Can we just rest a second?
Dialogue: 2,1:19:55.75,1:19:58.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-嗯。  -行。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:55.75,1:19:58.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Yeah.   -Sure.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:59.12,1:20:00.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦……
Dialogue: 1,1:19:59.12,1:20:00.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh...
Dialogue: 2,1:20:03.83,1:20:07.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，我要吸点O2。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:03.83,1:20:07.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh. I am gonna have some O2.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:09.75,1:20:11.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这东西里有什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:09.75,1:20:11.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What's in this thing?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:11.17,1:20:14.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，对，我觉得那个……是空的。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:11.17,1:20:14.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, yeah, I think that one's... empty.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:22.54,1:20:23.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这是什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:22.54,1:20:23.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What is this?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:27.04,1:20:28.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这是什么，Jon？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:27.04,1:20:28.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What is this, Jon?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:34.50,1:20:36.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}芬太尼。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:34.50,1:20:36.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Fentanyl.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:36.17,1:20:37.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你肯定在开玩笑。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:36.17,1:20:37.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You must be joking.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:38.67,1:20:40.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}为什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:38.67,1:20:40.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Why?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:41.08,1:20:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}为什么要用我们运毒？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:41.08,1:20:43.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Why use us as drug mules?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:43.96,1:20:45.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不是针对你。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:43.96,1:20:45.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It wasn't personal.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:46.38,1:20:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}游客来找我，想来趟难忘的旅行。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:46.38,1:20:49.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Tourists find me, want a memorable trip.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:50.83,1:20:52.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我就给他们一个。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:50.83,1:20:52.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So I give them one.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:53.96,1:20:55.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}然后他们掩护我。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:53.96,1:20:55.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And then they give me cover.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:56.50,1:20:58.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这样我一个人也不显得可疑。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:56.50,1:20:58.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So I don't look suspicious on my own.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:58.71,1:21:00.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他们永远都不会知道。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:58.71,1:21:00.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}They never find out.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:00.25,1:21:03.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他们就平平安安、开开心心回家了。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:00.25,1:21:03.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And they go home safe and happy.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:05.67,1:21:07.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没人会受伤。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:05.67,1:21:07.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No one gets hurt.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:07.25,1:21:09.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他们不给你打掩护。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:07.25,1:21:09.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}They don't give you cover.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:10.21,1:21:12.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你拿吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:10.21,1:21:12.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You take it.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:12.17,1:21:13.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有，万一我们被抓了，
Dialogue: 1,1:21:12.17,1:21:13.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Also, if we got caught,
Dialogue: 2,1:21:13.92,1:21:17.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们这辈子就得在泰国监狱里过了。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:13.92,1:21:17.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}we'd spend the rest of our lives in a Thai prison.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:18.75,1:21:20.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎，拜托。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:18.75,1:21:20.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:20.17,1:21:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你早就知道有风险。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:20.17,1:21:22.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You knew the risks.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:22.17,1:21:24.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你这趟徒步是违法的。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:22.17,1:21:24.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You are on an illegal hike.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:25.12,1:21:26.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你为了那事都准备犯法了。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:25.12,1:21:26.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You were ready to break the law for that.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:26.88,1:21:28.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那不是一回事。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:26.88,1:21:28.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's not the same thing.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:28.96,1:21:31.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-那是咱们自己选的。  -就是。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:28.96,1:21:31.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-We chose to do that.   -Exactly.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:31.42,1:21:33.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你连责任都担不起。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:31.42,1:21:33.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You can't even take responsibility.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:34.96,1:21:36.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你这怂包，真可悲。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:34.96,1:21:36.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're a pathetic coward.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:36.62,1:21:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}胆小鬼？
Dialogue: 1,1:21:36.62,1:21:38.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Coward?
Dialogue: 2,1:21:39.00,1:21:41.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是我救了你们的命。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:39.00,1:21:41.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I saved your lives.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:41.46,1:21:44.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}其实，我是冒着生命危险救你的。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:41.46,1:21:44.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}In fact, I risked mine to save yours.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:44.21,1:21:46.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你该谢我才对。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:44.21,1:21:46.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So you should be thanking me.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:46.21,1:21:47.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他疯了。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:46.21,1:21:47.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}He's crazy.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:47.42,1:21:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧，你没为了救我们“冒”生命危险。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:47.42,1:21:50.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, you didn't 'risk' your life to save us.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:50.92,1:21:53.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你冒险就为了这破玩意儿。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:50.92,1:21:53.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You risked it for this shit.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:53.21,1:21:56.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你要是想要它，到时就会为这事谢我。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:53.21,1:21:56.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}If you want it, then you'll be thanking me for this.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:56.38,1:21:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，不，不，不，不，不！不！
Dialogue: 1,1:21:56.38,1:21:58.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, no, no, no, no, no! No!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:01.21,1:22:03.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你完了。
Dialogue: 1,1:22:01.21,1:22:03.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're finished.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:23.67,1:22:25.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天哪。
Dialogue: 1,1:22:23.67,1:22:25.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:26.54,1:22:28.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她干嘛那么做？她没必要那么做啊。
Dialogue: 1,1:22:26.54,1:22:28.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Why did she do that? She didn't have to do that.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:28.62,1:22:29.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你做了什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:22:28.62,1:22:29.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What did you do?
Dialogue: 2,1:22:29.67,1:22:32.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那些罐子里的东西， 本来就不该让你看见。
Dialogue: 1,1:22:29.67,1:22:32.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You were never meant to see what was in those tanks.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:33.21,1:22:36.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，我不能在这儿坐牢，Jax。
Dialogue: 1,1:22:33.21,1:22:36.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, I can't go to jail here, Jax.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:36.38,1:22:38.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你不知道这儿监狱里是怎么对人的。
Dialogue: 1,1:22:36.38,1:22:38.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You don't know what they do to people in prison here.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:38.50,1:22:40.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你是个变态。  -不。不。
Dialogue: 1,1:22:38.50,1:22:40.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You're a psychopath.   -No. No.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:42.25,1:22:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，她掉下去了。
Dialogue: 1,1:22:42.25,1:22:43.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, she fell.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:44.46,1:22:46.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，这些山上老出事故，
Dialogue: 1,1:22:44.46,1:22:46.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, accidents happen all the time on these mountains,
Dialogue: 2,1:22:46.92,1:22:48.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}所以……
Dialogue: 1,1:22:46.92,1:22:48.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}so...
Dialogue: 2,1:22:52.75,1:22:53.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:22:52.75,1:22:53.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Arggh!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:53.96,1:22:55.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-不！不！  -Jax，别！
Dialogue: 1,1:22:53.96,1:22:55.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-No! No!   -Jax, don't!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:55.33,1:22:57.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}站那儿别动，不然我就 扔下去，我对天发誓！
Dialogue: 1,1:22:55.33,1:22:57.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You stay right there, or I will drop it, I swear to God!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:57.67,1:23:00.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就待在那儿，等救援人员到。
Dialogue: 1,1:22:57.67,1:23:00.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Stay right there until the emergency services arrive.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:07.50,1:23:09.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他们不会来了，对吧？
Dialogue: 1,1:23:07.50,1:23:09.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}They're not coming, are they?
Dialogue: 2,1:23:10.96,1:23:12.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有架直升机飞过来了。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:10.96,1:23:12.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}There is a helicopter coming.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:13.96,1:23:15.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可那不是紧急救援部门。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:13.96,1:23:15.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But it's not the emergency services.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:17.29,1:23:20.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}坐那一趟的代价，就是那罐里的东西。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:17.29,1:23:20.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And the cost of that ride is what is in that tank.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:21.75,1:23:23.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}所以别犯傻。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:21.75,1:23:23.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So do not be stupid.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:24.21,1:23:27.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听我说，你头两回没送成货……
Dialogue: 1,1:23:24.21,1:23:27.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look, first couple of times you fail a delivery...
Dialogue: 2,1:23:28.92,1:23:31.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你会少一根手指。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:28.92,1:23:31.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}you lose a finger.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:31.21,1:23:33.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}第三次，就是你的头了。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:31.21,1:23:33.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The third time, it's your head.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:33.88,1:23:36.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我跟大家一样，只想活下去。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:33.88,1:23:36.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm just trying to survive like everyone else.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:36.29,1:23:38.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那就把罐子放下。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:36.29,1:23:38.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So put down the canister.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:41.83,1:23:43.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:41.83,1:23:43.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:44.46,1:23:46.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你他妈就是个懦夫。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:44.46,1:23:46.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're a fucking coward.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:48.21,1:23:49.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不怕你。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:48.21,1:23:49.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm not afraid of you.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:49.92,1:23:51.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哼！
Dialogue: 1,1:23:49.92,1:23:51.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Grr!
Dialogue: 2,1:23:54.67,1:23:55.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:23:54.67,1:23:55.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Arggh!
Dialogue: 2,1:24:02.88,1:24:04.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:24:02.88,1:24:04.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Arggh!
Dialogue: 2,1:24:20.71,1:24:21.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:24:20.71,1:24:21.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Arggh!
Dialogue: 2,1:24:24.83,1:24:26.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:24:24.83,1:24:26.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Arggh!
Dialogue: 2,1:24:34.17,1:24:36.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是你逼我这么做的。
Dialogue: 1,1:24:34.17,1:24:36.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You made me do this.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:36.21,1:24:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这本来不用这么难。
Dialogue: 1,1:24:36.21,1:24:37.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This didn't have to be so hard.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:47.75,1:24:49.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:24:47.75,1:24:49.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Arggh!
Dialogue: 2,1:24:50.83,1:24:52.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:24:50.83,1:24:52.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Arggh!
Dialogue: 2,1:24:55.04,1:24:57.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:24:55.04,1:24:57.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Arggh! Arggh!
Dialogue: 2,1:26:01.71,1:26:03.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}扣上...
Dialogue: 1,1:26:01.71,1:26:03.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Clip in...
Dialogue: 2,1:26:03.79,1:26:05.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}解开锁扣。
Dialogue: 1,1:26:03.79,1:26:05.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}clip out.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:10.71,1:26:14.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊啊啊！
Dialogue: 1,1:26:10.71,1:26:14.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Aargghhhh!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:42.04,1:27:43.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}两杯威士忌。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:42.04,1:27:43.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Two whiskies.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:43.62,1:27:45.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}直走。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:43.62,1:27:45.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Straight.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:19.75,1:28:21.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}谢谢，Billie。
Dialogue: 1,1:28:19.75,1:28:21.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thanks, Billie.
